msgid "**Break-glass path:** ``disabled`` also refuses the password login on the server, so with SSO on the seeded administrator signs in through Keycloak by e-mail. When Keycloak is unavailable, set ``users_registration_mode`` back to ``existing`` with ``bundle exec rails runner 'Decidim::Organization.first.update!(users_registration_mode: :existing)'`` inside the Decidim container, or redeploy with ``applications.web-app-decidim.services.decidim.login.method.native.enabled: true``; the administrator then signs in at ``/users/sign_in`` with its e-mail address and password."
