msgid "**Break-glass path:** the local administrator signs in through `POST /Users/AuthenticateByName` of the Jellyfin API or through any native Jellyfin app with its local password, whatever the web sign-in page shows; the Playwright helper `signInViaBreakGlass` hands such an API session to the web client."
