msgid "**Break-glass:** With SSO on, the platform administrator is a Keycloak account without a local password. The local administrator sets one from inside the ``open-webui`` container with `files/python/administrator.py <./files/python/administrator.py>`__ (``OPENWEBUI_ADMIN_EMAIL``, ``OPENWEBUI_ADMIN_NAME``, ``OPENWEBUI_ADMIN_PASSWORD`` in the environment, piped into ``python3 -``, as ``tasks/utils/admin.yml`` does without SSO), then signs in at ``/auth?form=1``."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Break-glass:** With SSO on, the platform administrator is a Keycloak account without a local password. The local administrator sets one from inside the `open-webui` container with [files/python/administrator.py](./files/python/administrator.py) (`OPENWEBUI_ADMIN_EMAIL`, `OPENWEBUI_ADMIN_NAME`, `OPENWEBUI_ADMIN_PASSWORD` in the environment, piped into `python3 -`, as `tasks/utils/admin.yml` does without SSO), then signs in at `/auth?form=1`."
