msgid "**Break-glass:** With SSO on, the platform administrator signs in with the local password through the Synapse client API (``POST /_matrix/client/v3/login``, ``m.login.password``), or in Element through ``#/login?sso_redirect=false``: Element runs its SSO redirect only when it boots on exactly ``#/login`` or ``#/welcome``."
