msgid "**Break-glass:** With the form off, the platform administrator keeps the HTTP API through basic authentication with the local password (`[service] ENABLE_BASIC_AUTHENTICATION` stays on) and the `gitea admin user` CLI inside the container. Setting `services.gitea.login.method.native.enabled: true` in the inventory brings the form back."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Break-glass:** With the form off, the platform administrator keeps the HTTP API through basic authentication with the local password (``[service] ENABLE_BASIC_AUTHENTICATION`` stays on) and the ``gitea admin user`` CLI inside the container. Setting ``services.gitea.login.method.native.enabled: true`` in the inventory brings the form back."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Break-glass:** the recovery admin `STALWART_ADMIN_USER` always signs in through Stalwart's own form at `/account/login`, with and without SSO; `files/playwright/test-login-native.js` proves it in every mode."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Break-glass:** the recovery admin ``STALWART_ADMIN_USER`` always signs in through Stalwart’s own form at ``/account/login``, with and without SSO; ``files/playwright/test-login-native.js`` proves it in every mode."
