msgid "**Break-glass:** the role’s administrator is a Greenlight ``Administrator``, not a ``SuperAdmin``, so with SSO on no form admits it. Reach the instance through the Rails runner of the ``greenlight`` container (``bundle exec rails runner``), the same channel `files/ruby/greenlight/ensure_admin.rb <./files/ruby/greenlight/ensure_admin.rb>`__ uses."
