msgid "**Configurable remote models:** The published remote models are the ``litellm.remote_models`` list in ``meta/services.yml``, each entry an ``alias``, the LiteLLM ``model`` string and its ``provider``, plus an optional ``context`` in tokens and an optional ``max_output_tokens`` that becomes the route’s ``max_tokens`` and aborts the deploy unless it is a positive integer. A remote route without it sets no bound, so the client’s own limit applies; the shared ``services.litellm.max_output_tokens`` bounds only the local Ollama and LM Studio routes. An inventory replaces the list through ``applications.svc-ai-litellm.services.litellm.remote_models``, and a provider without a key slot aborts the deploy."
