msgid "**Directory Profile at Every LDAP Sign-In:** ```files/php/iam/profile_ldap_user_provider.php`` <./files/php/iam/profile_ldap_user_provider.php>`__ replaces the LDAP user provider of the auto-create login. It hands every attribute of ``ldap.autocreate.extra_fields_map`` (```templates/ldap.yaml.j2`` <./templates/ldap.yaml.j2>`__) the entry holds to a new account, skips the absent ones, and writes the ``SUITECRM_LDAP_PROFILE_COLUMNS`` of an existing account from the entry at each sign-in."
