msgid "**Directory Profile:** Contact, address, locale and organization attributes from OpenLDAP appear in the account and admin consoles under \"Contact and locale\" (user-editable) and \"Organization\" (administrator-only), and reach applications through the standard `profile`, `phone` and `address` claims."
