# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**MinIO** is an S3-compatible object storage service for files, media, backups, and AI artifacts, self-hosted for performance and control."
msgstr "**MinIO** je S3-kompatibilná služba na ukladanie objektov pre súbory, médiá, zálohy a AI artefakty, self-hosted pre výkon a kontrolu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mini-QR** is a lightweight, self-hosted web application for generating QR codes instantly and privately."
msgstr "**Mini- QR** je ľahká, self-hosted webová aplikácia pre generovanie QR kódov okamžite a súkromne."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mini-QR** is a lightweight, self-hosted web application for generating QR codes instantly and privately.   It provides a minimal and elegant interface to convert any text, URL, or message into a QR code directly in your browser, without external tracking or dependencies."
msgstr "**Mini- QR** je ľahká, self-hosted webová aplikácia pre generovanie QR kódov okamžite a súkromne. Poskytuje minimálne a elegantné rozhranie na prevod akéhokoľvek textu, URL alebo správy do QR kódu priamo vo vašom prehliadači, bez externého sledovania alebo závislostí."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Minimal NGINX Setup:** Clean and optimized default configurations."
msgstr "**Minimálne nastavenie NGINX:** Čisté a optimalizované štandardné konfigurácie."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Minimal Setup:** No unnecessary dependencies are installed."
msgstr "**Minimálne nastavenie:** Nie sú nainštalované žiadne zbytočné závislosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Minimal footprint:** Does not enable services or autostart entries beyond what the package itself provides."
msgstr "**Minimálna stopa:** Nepovoľuje služby ani položky autostart nad rámec toho, čo samotný balík poskytuje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Minimal footprint:** Small Node.js/Express service that fits neatly into larger stacks."
msgstr "**Minimálna stopa:** Malé Node.js/Express služba, ktorá sa hodí úhľadne do väčších komínov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Minimal scope** (client-only, no server configuration)"
msgstr "**Minimálny rozsah pôsobnosti** (iba klient, bez konfigurácie servera)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mirror failover:** A repository that declares a mirror is served through a guarded location: a 5xx from its primary remote re-runs the same path against the sibling repository, while a 404 is passed straight back."
msgstr "**Zrkadlo zlyhalo:** Archív, ktorý deklaruje zrkadlo sa podáva cez strážené miesto: a 5xx od svojho primárneho diaľkového re-run rovnakú cestu proti súrodeneckým úložisku, zatiaľ čo 404 prechádza rovno dozadu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mitigation:** Image-level mutation (`run`, `build`, `push`, `login`) and their synonyms (`docker container run`, `docker image build`, `docker buildx build`, `docker image push`) still route through `ask`, so the operator reviews them before they execute."
msgstr "**Zmiernenie:** Mutácia na úrovni obrázku (`run`, `build`, `push`, `login`) a ich synonymá (`docker container run`, `docker image build`, `docker buildx build`, `docker image push`) stále cesta cez `ask`, takže operátor skúma je pred vykonaním."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mitigation:** Targets still cannot bypass `allowWrite`, `allowedDomains`, or the `deny` list. A malicious target that called `rm -rf .` would be stopped by the `rm -rf*` deny rule."
msgstr "**Zmiernenie:** Ciele stále nemôžu obísť `allowWrite`, `allowedDomains`, alebo `deny` zoznam. Zlomyselný cieľ, ktorý sa volal `rm -rf .` sa zastaví `rm -rf*` Popieraj pravidlo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mitigation:** `docker run*` and its synonyms are in `ask`, so the operator reviews them (subject to Assumption 5). The `deny` list blocks `sudo*`, so direct privilege escalation via `sudo` is unavailable."
msgstr "**Zmiernenie:** `docker run*` a jeho synonymá sú `ask`, takže operátor skúma ich (s výhradou predpokladu 5). `deny` Zoznam blokov `sudo*`, takže priame privilégium eskalácia prostredníctvom `sudo` nie je k dispozícii."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mitigation:** `sandbox.enabled: true` with `sandbox.failIfUnavailable: true` refuses to start when the backend is unavailable. `sandbox.allowUnsandboxedCommands: false` rejects the `dangerouslyDisableSandbox: true` tool parameter, so there is no per-call escape."
msgstr "**Zmiernenie:** `sandbox.enabled: true` s `sandbox.failIfUnavailable: true` odmieta začať, keď je backend nedostupný. `sandbox.allowUnsandboxedCommands: false` odmieta `dangerouslyDisableSandbox: true` Parameter nástrojov, takže nie je žiadny únikový hovor."

msgid "**Mobilizon identity:** the bridge publishes as the platform administrator through Mobilizon's database login, which is off whenever Mobilizon's native login method is off. The sidecar parses records any platform PDS user can write while it holds the global administrator password, so a dedicated bridge account replaces this before `alpha` (operator, 2026-11-04)."
msgstr ""

