msgstr "**Multi-Server Management:** Pripojenie a podanie viacerých PostgreSQL prípady z jedného rozhrania."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mutating commands that stay inside `allowWrite`** (e.g. `make test`, `pip install`, `docker build`, though builds still route through `ask`) just work under the sandbox."
msgstr "**Mutating príkazy, ktoré zostávajú vnútri `allowWrite`** (napr. `make test`, `pip install`, `docker build`, aj keď stavia stále cesta cez `ask`) Len pracuj pod pieskoviskom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mutating commands that target paths outside `allowWrite`** (e.g. `mv ~/file /etc/`) fail at the sandbox layer with EROFS."
msgstr "**Mutating commands that target trades outside `allowWrite`** (napr. `mv ~/file /etc/`) zlyhajú pri vrstve pieskoviska s EROFS."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**NFS for stateful databases.** v1 keeps DB data volumes local-only with node-pinning. Reconsidering this requires a separate requirement covering DB-specific NFS semantics (locking, fsync, version compatibility per engine)."
msgstr "**NFS pre pozoruhodné databázy.** v1 udržuje DB dáta iba lokálne s uzol-pinning. Prehodnotenie si vyžaduje osobitnú požiadavku vzťahujúcu sa na sémantiku NFS špecifickú pre DB (zamykanie, fsync, verzia kompatibility na motor)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**NFS-backed shared volumes** so that the Swarm scheduler can move a container between nodes without losing volume state."
msgstr "**Spoločné objemy kryté NFS** tak, aby rozpisovač rojov mohol presunúť kontajner medzi uzlami bez straty stavu objemu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**NFS-backed storage:** ``docker_registry_data`` survives container/manager restarts when storage backend is NFS."
msgstr "**Sklad krytý NFS:** ``docker_registry_data`` prežije kontajner/manažér reštartuje, keď pamäťový backend je NFS."

# translated-by: libretranslate
