# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**OIDC JVM CA trust (self-signed TLS only):** when `TLS_MODE == self_signed`, the backend command (in `templates/compose.yml.j2`) imports the internal CA into a writable `cacerts` copy and points the JVM at it via `JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS`. The shared `with-ca-trust.sh` entrypoint covers the OS/NSS/env trust stores but not the JVM truststore, so without this Penpot's server-side OIDC token/userinfo calls to Keycloak fail with `PKIX path building failed`. The override is gated behind self-signed mode (it is a no-op in production, where real CA-signed certs are already trusted) and the CA path is hardcoded because the framework's CA-override re-serialises the command."
msgstr "**OIDC JVM CA dôvera (iba vlastné TLS):** keď `TLS_MODE == self_signed`, backend príkaz (on `templates/compose.yml.j2`) dovoz vnútornej CA do zapisovateľného `cacerts` skopírovať a ukazuje JVM na to cez `JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS`. `with-ca-trust.sh` vstupný bod zahŕňa OS/NSS/env Dôverovať obchody, ale nie JVM truststore, takže bez tohto Penpot's server-side OIDC token/userinfo hovory na Keycloak zlyhalo `PKIX path building failed`@ info: whatsthis (je to neop vo výrobe, kde skutočné CA-signed certs sú už dôveryhodné) a cesta CA je hardcoded pretože rámec CA-override znovu serializuje príkaz."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**OIDC JVM CA trust (self-signed TLS only):** when ``TLS_MODE == self_signed``, the backend command (in ``templates/compose.yml.j2``) imports the internal CA into a writable ``cacerts`` copy and points the JVM at it via ``JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS``. The shared ``with-ca-trust.sh`` entrypoint covers the OS/NSS/env trust stores but not the JVM truststore, so without this Penpot’s server-side OIDC token/userinfo calls to Keycloak fail with ``PKIX path building failed``. The override is gated behind self-signed mode (it is a no-op in production, where real CA-signed certs are already trusted) and the CA path is hardcoded because the framework’s CA-override re-serialises the command."
msgstr "**OIDC JVM CA dôvera (iba vlastné TLS):** keď ``TLS_MODE == self_signed``, backend príkaz (on ``templates/compose.yml.j2``) dovoz vnútornej CA do zapisovateľného ``cacerts`` skopírovať a ukazuje JVM na to cez ``JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS``. ``with-ca-trust.sh`` vstupný bod zahŕňa OS/NSS/env Dôverovať obchody, ale nie JVM truststore, takže bez tohto Penpot Keycloak zlyhalo ``PKIX path building failed``@ info: whatsthis (je to neop vo výrobe, kde skutočné CA-signed certs sú už dôveryhodné) a CA cesta je hardcoded, pretože rámec je CA-override re-serializuje príkaz."

