# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Pinned tool surface:** `files/mcp/tools.json` holds the 24 read-only tools captured from the sidecar, pinned twice: `tools.schema_sha256` over the parsed mapping the adapter rehashes at startup, and `adapter.specification_sha256` over the file bytes."
msgstr "**Pinovaný povrch nástroja:** `files/mcp/tools.json` má 24 nástroje iba na čítanie zachytené z postranného vozíka, pripnuté dvakrát: `tools.schema_sha256` cez parsed mapovanie adaptér rehashes pri štarte, a `adapter.specification_sha256` cez bajty."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Pinned upstream client:** Build the ``social-app`` web client from a pinned tag so the broker’s ``BSKY_STORAGE`` handoff stays in sync with the upstream persistence schema."
msgstr "**Pinned upground klient:** Stavať ``social-app`` web klient z pinned tag, takže makléri ``BSKY_STORAGE`` Odovzdanie zostáva v súlade s protiprúdovou perzistenciou schémy."

