msgid "**Pinned-Release Upgrades:** On boot, an installed SuiteCRM older than the pinned ``app_version`` is upgraded through SuiteCRM’s own ``suitecrm:app:upgrade`` and ``suitecrm:app:upgrade-finalize``, with the image’s patched tree as the upgrade package; a tree newer than the pin stops the container ⬆️"
