# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Redacted audit trail:** Every call emits provider, consumer, tool, credential subject, status, duration and correlation id, and never the arguments, the response body or the credential."
msgstr "**Redacted audit trail:** Každý hovor vysiela poskytovateľa, spotrebiteľa, nástroj, vierohodný subjekt, stav, trvanie a korelácia id, a nikdy argumenty, orgán odpovede alebo vierohodné."

msgid "**Redacted request path**: both access log formats write the path without query string, Referer or basic-auth user. Path segments after a password-reset, e-mail confirmation, e-mail login or account activation route (e.g. `/password/reset/`, `/confirm-email/`) are written as `[redacted]`; extend the `$infinito_access_log_path` map in [nginx.conf.j2](./templates/nginx.conf.j2) for further token routes."
msgstr ""

