msgid "**SSO via Keycloak:** configured automatically on first deploy; name and email of a new account come from the ``name`` and ``email`` claims."
msgstr ""

msgid "**SSO via Keycloak:** configured automatically on first deploy; name and email of a new account come from the `name` and `email` claims."
