msgid "**Shared LiteLLM gateway consumer**: `litellm` service flag plus `secrets.credentials.litellm_api_key` in [`web-app-openclaw`](../../roles/web-app-openclaw/meta/services.yml)."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Shared cache stack**, claimed by every session and never a candidate: `infinito-registry-cache`, `infinito-package-cache`, `infinito-package-cache-frontend`, `infinito-coredns`, the network `infinito-nexus-core_default` and `/var/cache/infinito/core/cache`."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Shared foreign target.** The development stack's `compose.yml` gains a `target` service (systemd, sshd, wildcard resolver) that starts by default with `make compose-up` and in CI and serves compose and swarm rounds alike. One shared script resets it before each use. The `web-app-docs` instruction replay moves onto this target; its own `machine.sh`, `sshd.sh`, resolver and compose project are refactored into the shared logic."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Shared form.** Where one form serves local and LDAP accounts (Gitea, Open WebUI, Matrix, MinIO, Semaphore, Zammad, Odoo), the LDAP mode keeps the form for LDAP, and `native: false` means no local account signs in except the break-glass admin wherever the app can tell the two apart; where it cannot, the role README states that the form is shared."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Shared image**: toolchain stage, input-hash tag, context limited to the inputs, published final stage, image cleanup."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Shared instance:** one container serves every consumer that carries the service flag."
msgstr "**Spoločný prípad:** jeden kontajner slúži každému spotrebiteľovi, ktorý nesie zástavu služby."

msgid "**Shared isolation contract:** a box exposes only the project directory and its own Docker daemon, the same rules as the server workspace."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Shared lockout:** the server counts failed logins per client address, and behind the front proxy every client has the proxy's address. Ten failed logins within fifteen minutes lock the form for everyone. The oauth2 gate keeps anonymous visitors from reaching it; without Keycloak the form is public."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Shared lockout:** the server counts failed logins per client address, and behind the front proxy every client has the proxy’s address. Ten failed logins within fifteen minutes lock the form for everyone. The oauth2 gate keeps anonymous visitors from reaching it; without Keycloak the form is public."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Shared platform team:** Penpot has no instance administrator, only roles per team, so the role groups map onto one team named after `ORGANIZATION` that the platform administrator owns: `administrator` members are team admins, `editor` members editors and `viewer` members viewers; a profile outside all three leaves the team the way Penpot's own leave does. [files/sql/rbac/reconcile.sql](./files/sql/rbac/reconcile.sql) runs in the database as an RBAC hook of [sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync](../sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync/) at every deploy and on its timer; it creates the team once the administrator's profile exists and matches members by e-mail, so a member joins on the first run after their first sign-in."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Shared platform team:** Penpot has no instance administrator, only roles per team, so the role groups map onto one team named after ``ORGANIZATION`` that the platform administrator owns: ``administrator`` members are team admins, ``editor`` members editors and ``viewer`` members viewers; a profile outside all three leaves the team the way Penpot’s own leave does. `files/sql/rbac/reconcile.sql <./files/sql/rbac/reconcile.sql>`__ runs in the database as an RBAC hook of `sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync <../sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync/>`__ at every deploy and on its timer; it creates the team once the administrator’s profile exists and matches members by e-mail, so a member joins on the first run after their first sign-in."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Shared styling:** when ``web-svc-design`` is present, the site consumes the central stylesheet."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Shared styling:** when `web-svc-design` is present, the site consumes the central stylesheet."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Shared test runner**: tests and lints in `infinito-test-<hash>`; no test or lint target starts a deploy stack."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Shared-service auto-include** from each role's `meta/services.yml.<entity>.<service>` block, when both `enabled` AND `shared` pass `is_explicit_truth` in [registry.py](../../../utils/roles/applications/services/registry.py): the literal `True` or the dynamic form `\"{{ '<role>' in group_names }}\"`. A literal `false` (as baked by a variant override) does NOT qualify."
msgstr "**Autoobsluha zdieľanej služby zahŕňa** z každej úlohy `meta/services.yml.<entity>.<service>` blok, keď oba `enabled` A `shared` prejsť `is_explicit_truth` on [registry.py](../../../utils/roles/applications/services/registry.py): doslovný `True` alebo dynamická forma `\"{{ '<role>' in group_names }}\"`. Doslova. `false` (ako pečené variantným prepisom) nespĺňa požiadavky."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Shell loops are FORBIDDEN. ⛔** You MUST NOT use `for`, `while`, `until`, or any other shell loop construct in any Bash tool call. Reason: shell control structures fall outside the sandbox auto-allow heuristic and trigger approval prompts even when every subcommand would individually auto-allow."
msgstr "**Shell slučky sú FORBIDDEN. ⛔** Nesmiete použiť `for`, `while`, `until`, alebo akýkoľvek iný shell slučka konštrukcia v akomkoľvek Bash nástroji volanie. Dôvod: riadiace konštrukcie škrupiny spadajú mimo pieskovisko auto-umožňujú heuristiku a spustiť schvaľovacie podnety, aj keď každý podpríkaz by individuálne auto-umožniť."

msgid "**Sidecar report:** Lists other PHP containers of a hardened stack, such as cron or worker sidecars, as info without failing."
