msgid "A change is incompatible with prior inventories, on-disk role-meta layout, deploy CLI, or stored runtime state."
msgstr "Zmena je nezlučiteľná s predchádzajúcimi inventármi, rozložením rolí na disku, nasadzovaním CLI alebo uloženým časovým stavom."

msgid "A change that makes the clock smaller by testing less is reported to the operator as a coverage cut for them to decide, never applied as a tuning."
