msgid "A comparison is invalid across a changed image state, a one-time cost, a shared-cache re-render outlier, a wait that hides a failure, or a machine another gate, deploy or translation shared; one full suite runs at a time and the log is persisted outside `/tmp` before measuring."
msgstr ""

msgid "A comparison is invalid when the two runs differ in image state, when one pays a one-time cost (a first-run purge, a migration), when a SPOT re-render shows up as a single carry outlier, when a wait hides a failure (count `FAILED - RETRYING`; a long wait may be a ban, not slowness), or when another gate, deploy or translation shared the machine. Run one full suite at a time and persist logs outside `/tmp` before measuring."
