msgid "A local deploy is failing on the host"
msgstr "Miestne nasadenie zlyháva na hostiteľa"

msgid "A localhost inventory bundle for the whole agent infrastructure, a local setup workflow and a SaaS integration workflow, both runnable through act, and an iteration plan for autonomous implementation."
