msgid "A role invokes another role when an ``include_role``/``import_role`` names it (literally, through a literal loop item, or through a template whose literal part narrows a glob), when one of its tasks hands a role name to an include as a ``vars`` value (``load_app_id``, ``list_or_shoot_roles``), and when it includes a task or handler file of that role by path. A role that includes a bare template no loop resolves invokes every role its ``vars`` and ``defaults`` name in quotes."
