msgid "An inventory that predates this role lists only the provider group. Add `web-app-email` to the same hosts before the next deploy, or every consumer deploys with mail switched off. The inventory validator rejects a provider without the wrapper; see [Upgrading an existing inventory](../../docs/administration/configuration/email.md#upgrading-an-existing-inventory-) for the full note."
