msgid "An option the router never offered is refused"
msgstr "Možnosť, ktorú router nikdy neponúkol, je zamietnutá"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "An optional `PROXY_HEADER_SSO_ADMIN_GROUP` check against `X-Forwarded-Groups` restricts the owner session to members of the application's administrator RBAC group."
msgstr "Voliteľné `PROXY_HEADER_SSO_ADMIN_GROUP` kontrola proti `X-Forwarded-Groups` obmedzuje reláciu vlastníka na členov skupiny správcu žiadosti RBAC."

msgid "An optional `RESCUE_DEADLINE` epoch caps every command on every level; once it has passed, each remaining capture is written as a `[skipped: past RESCUE_DEADLINE]` placeholder. The compose trap in [dedicated.sh](../../scripts/tests/deploy/ci/dedicated.sh) sets it through [rescue/window.sh](../../scripts/tests/deploy/utils/rescue/window.sh) only when the distro budget's SIGTERM has already arrived."
