msgid "Baserow's Caddy layer answers only the hosts named in `BASEROW_PUBLIC_URL` and `BASEROW_EXTRA_PUBLIC_URLS`; any other host is treated as a published builder domain and gets `404`. The role lists every network sibling of the canonical URL in `BASEROW_EXTRA_PUBLIC_URLS`, so the onion vhost's `/healthz/ready` probe still reaches the backend."
