msgid "Each **Acceptance Criterion** MUST be written as a Markdown task list item (`- [ ]`)."
msgstr "Každý **Kritérium prijateľnosti** MUSÍ byť napísaná ako položka zoznamu úloh Markdown (`- [ ]`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each PR-opening job in [cron-update.yml](../../../../../.github/workflows/cron-update.yml) runs an `actions/create-github-app-token@v2` step gated on `steps.diff.outputs.changed == 'true'`, then forwards the minted token as `GH_TOKEN` and the resolved `APP_SLUG` to the subsequent PR step. The job's `permissions:` block keeps the workflow-provided `GITHUB_TOKEN` read-only; write access is provided exclusively by the App token, scoped to the App's repository permissions."
msgstr "Každá PR-otvorenie práce v [cron-update.yml](../../../../../.github/workflows/cron-update.yml) spustí `actions/create-github-app-token@v2` step degged on `steps.diff.outputs.changed == 'true'`, potom predá razený token ako `GH_TOKEN` a vyriešené `APP_SLUG` k následnému kroku PR. Práca je `permissions:` blok udržiava pracovné postupy poskytované `GITHUB_TOKEN` read-only; zapisovať prístup je poskytovaný výhradne App token, s rozsahom do App's repository oprávnení."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each Raspberry Pi joins the swarm as an agent node labelled `kata-capable` with the isolating runtime as its daemon-wide default (Decision #3, applied per node). Flowise and the gateway run on a manager node. Swarm distributes agent replicas across the Pis; adding a Pi adds agent capacity with no code change. The Pis do **not** run large models locally: agents speak only the gateway `/v1`, which routes light work to a small local `svc-ai-ollama` and heavy work to a GPU or external backend. All node-run images MUST be `arm64`."
msgstr "Každý Malinová Pi sa pripojí roj ako agent uzol označený `kata-capable` s izolujúcim časom ako predvolený démon (Rozhodnutie #3, aplikovaný na uzol). Flowise a brána beží na uzle manažéra. Roh distribuuje repliky agenta cez Pis; pridanie Pi pridáva kapacitu agenta bez zmeny kódu. The Pis do **nie** spustiť veľké modely lokálne: agenti hovoria iba brána `/v1`, ktoré trasy svetlo pracovať na malé miestne `svc-ai-ollama` a ťažká práca na GPU alebo externý backend. Všetky uzol-run obrázky MUSÍ byť `arm64`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each Recoverer parses and validates its own colon-encoded ``source`` and builds the role's ``files/python/recover.py`` invocation. Colon segments are classified by shape: an ABSOLUTE path is the restore destination (replacing a --target flag); for device a RELATIVE segment is the on-device snapshot subpath and an all-digit ``YYYYMMDDHHMMSS`` segment is the generation to restore. No colon means the derived standard-layout target and the newest generation. The uniform console command ``<type> <source> <target>`` dispatches to one Recoverer via :data:`RECOVERERS`."
msgstr "Každý Recover parses a potvrdzuje svoje vlastné hrubého čreva kódovaný ``source`` a buduje úlohu ``files/python/recover.py`` povolávanie. Colon segmenty sú klasifikované podľa tvaru: cesta ABSOLUTE je obnovenie cieľa (ktorým sa nahrádza vlajka --cieľ); pre zariadenie RELATIVE segment je on-device snímka podpatka a všetky-ciferné ``YYYYMMDDHHMMSS`` segment je generácia obnoviť. Žiadne hrubé črevo znamená odvodený štandardný cieľ a najnovšia generácia. Jednotný príkaz konzoly ``<type> <source> <target>`` expedície do jedného Recover cez :data:`RECOVERERS`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Each `tasks/02_manager_ops/06_plugin/<step>.yml` file owns exactly one OCC stage and one decision about whether to continue."
msgstr "Každý `tasks/02_manager_ops/06_plugin/<step>.yml` súbor vlastní presne jednu fázu OCC a jedno rozhodnutie o tom, či pokračovať."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Each `test()` runs in its own isolated browser context. Specs MUST NOT share session state between tests. Running biber and administrator as two separate `test()` blocks already gives that isolation by default. When a single scenario needs more than one identity at once (peer-to-peer messaging, RBAC promotion observed by the admin, …), it MUST open a fresh `browser.newContext({ ignoreHTTPSErrors: true })` per identity and close them in `finally`."
msgstr "Každý `test()` beží vo vlastnom izolovanom kontexte prehliadača. Specs NESMIE zdieľať relačný stav medzi testami. Beh bishop a správca ako dva samostatné `test()` bloky už dáva túto izoláciu štandardne. Ak jeden scenár potrebuje naraz viac ako jednu identitu (peer-to-peer správ, RBAC propagácie pozorované admin, ...), to MUSÍ otvoriť čerstvé `browser.newContext({ ignoreHTTPSErrors: true })` na identitu a uzavrieť ich v `finally`."

msgid "Each acceptance criterion that only a running stack can prove carries a scenario under ``agents/scenarios/`` (see that directory's ``README.md``): a flat YAML document with ``id``, ``criterion``, ``mode``, ``given``, ``when`` and ``then``. ``make agents-verify`` deploys the agents bundle and calls this module to run the selected scenarios and print the one result table the requirement asks for: id, mode, result, duration, log path."
