msgid "Every page of the default source loads `https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-MBZGKNMDWC`, the Google tag of the upstream Hugo project (measured on the compose stack: the request leaves the browser, and the beacon that follows to `region1.google-analytics.com/g/collect` is refused by `connect-src`). Cause: `services.hugo.hugo_environment: production` in `meta/services.yml` makes the theme render its analytics partial with the id from upstream's `hugo.toml`, and `meta/csp.yml` whitelists the tag host. Options: build with another Hugo environment; or pass an empty `HUGO_SERVICES_GOOGLEANALYTICS_ID` as a build argument and drop the two whitelist entries."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every path either deploys on the assigned kind, reports the substitution, or fails. None of them substitutes in silence."
msgstr "Každá cesta buď nasadzuje na pridelený druh, hlási substitúciu, alebo zlyhá. Nikto z nich nenahradí ticho."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every path that cannot route rejects the request with its reason instead of answering. The hook returns a string when the proxy has no router or when no served model can take the request, and the proxy turns that into a `RejectedRequestError` carrying the text. The alias's own `model_list` entry exists only so the name is listable and carries `mock_response: litellm.InternalServerError`, so reaching it at all raises. Both halves matter, because a router that silently served whatever was first would hide its own failure behind a plausible reply, and the alias exists precisely so callers do not have to know which model answered."
msgstr "Každá cesta, ktorá nemôže trasu odmietnuť žiadosť s jej dôvodom namiesto odpovede. Háčik vráti reťazec, keď proxy nemá router alebo keď žiadny slúžil model môže vziať žiadosť, a proxy zmení, že do `RejectedRequestError` s textom. Prezývka `model_list` zápis existuje len preto, že názov je zoznamovateľný a nesie `mock_response: litellm.InternalServerError`, takže dosiahnutie to vôbec zvyšuje. Na oboch poloviciach záleží, pretože router, ktorý potichu slúžil tomu, čo bolo prvé, by zakryl svoje vlastné zlyhanie za vierohodnú odpoveď, a alias existuje presne tak volajúci nemusia vedieť, ktorý model odpovedal."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every per-tool module MUST expose the same surface so the dispatcher can call it uniformly:"
