msgid "Infinito.Nexus is not one application. It is a repository of building blocks for deploying, operating, and maintaining self-hosted systems."
msgstr "Infinito.Nexus nie je jedna žiadosť. Je to úložisko stavebných kameňov pre nasadenie, prevádzku a údržbu self-hosted systémov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Infinito.Nexus supports more than one backend for rendering and running an application role's containers. This page documents the abstraction that keeps per-role declarations identical across backends so adding a new backend is additive, not a rewrite."
msgstr "Infinito.Nexus podporuje viac ako jeden backend pre vykresľovanie a spustenie aplikačnej role kontajnery. Táto stránka dokumentuje abstrakcia, ktorá udržuje pre-role vyhlásenia identické cez backendy, takže pridanie nového backend je prísadou, nie prepísať."

msgid "Infinito.Nexus up to v0.10.0 ran the Bitnami image with ``moodle_code`` at ``/bitnami/moodle`` and ``moodle_data`` at ``/bitnami/moodledata``. Both volumes keep their names, and the code and the data sit at the volume root in both layouts, so nothing moves. The entrypoint names a code volume whose ``config.php`` points below ``/bitnami`` in its log, adopts its release, replaces the tree and the ``config.php``, and hands the data volume to ``www-data`` (uid 33)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Infinito.Nexus up to v0.10.0 ran the Bitnami image with `moodle_code` at `/bitnami/moodle` and `moodle_data` at `/bitnami/moodledata`. Both volumes keep their names, and the code and the data sit at the volume root in both layouts, so nothing moves. The entrypoint names a code volume whose `config.php` points below `/bitnami` in its log, adopts its release, replaces the tree and the `config.php`, and hands the data volume to `www-data` (uid 33)."
msgstr ""

