msgid "Integration tests that statically validate every `lookup('config', application_id, …)` (and quoted-app variants) found in role YAML and Jinja templates against the role's effective configuration."
msgstr "Integračné testy, ktoré staticky potvrdzujú každý `lookup('config', application_id, …)` (a uvedené varianty aplikácií) nájdené v role YAML a Jinja šablóny proti účinnej konfigurácie role."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that validate Docker Compose templates across roles: every service MUST declare an `image`, templates MUST NOT call raw `docker` commands, and `build:` blocks MUST still carry an image reference."
msgstr "Integračné testy, ktoré potvrdzujú Docker Compose šablóny medzi rolami: každá služba MUSÍ deklarovať `image`, šablóny nesmú volať surové `docker` príkazy a `build:` bloky MUSIA stále niesť odkaz na obrázok."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that validate Docker-level contracts for role services: compose template includes, declared service keys, and image/version validity."
msgstr "Integračné testy, ktoré potvrdzujú Docker-level zmluvy pre rolové služby: skladať šablónu zahŕňa, deklarované servisné kľúče, a platnosť obrazu/verzie."

msgid "Integration tests that validate `meta/categories.yml`: every declared category path MUST correspond to an existing directory under `roles/`, `invokable: true` MUST NOT appear on any descendant of an already-invokable ancestor, and every category MUST declare a `glyph` label that is unique among its siblings."
