# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Integration tests that validate the contents of `group_vars/all/*.yml`: no Jinja recursion cycles, consistent user/application cross-references, and internal schema rules."
msgstr "Integračné testy, ktoré potvrdzujú obsah `group_vars/all/*.yml`: žiadne Jinja rekurzné cykly, konzistentné užívateľské/aplikačné krížové odkazy a vnútorné pravidlá schémy."

msgid "Integration tests that validate the service registry discovered from `roles/*/meta/services.yml`: canonical aliases are consistent, every service key resolves via `plugins/lookup/service.py`, `sys-svc-*` roles carry a `system_service_id` matching their folder, and transitive dependencies (e.g. dashboard → mailu) are declared correctly."
