# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Taiga redirects `/` to the public `/discover` showcase, which renders a bare Login link but not the OIDC entry point; only `/login` binds the SSO directive (see the note in [`files/playwright/_shared.js`](./files/playwright/_shared.js)). The shared personas always enter at the site root, so they can never reach Taiga's SSO button. Taiga's AngularJS shell additionally exposes logout only through `ng-click` / `tg-nav` / `ui-sref` directives, which the generic in-app logout helper cannot activate. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; the equivalent journeys are driven by the role-local `test-login-oidc.js` and `test-login-native.js` specs, which enter at `/login` and log out through Taiga's own control."
msgstr "Taiga presmerovanie `/` pre verejnosť `/discover` Prezentácia, ktorá vytvára holý Prihlasovací odkaz, ale nie vstupný bod OIDC; `/login` zaväzuje smernicu SSO (pozri poznámku v [`files/playwright/_shared.js`](./files/playwright/_shared.js)). Zdieľané osoby vždy vstúpiť na mieste koreňa, takže sa nikdy dostať TaigaTlačidlo SSO. Taiga je AngularJS shell navyše vystavuje odhlásenie len cez `ng-click` / `tg-nav` / `ui-sref` smernice, ktoré všeobecný pomocník pri odhlásení v aplikácii nemôže aktivovať. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) teda deklaruje `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` a `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; rovnocenné cesty sa riadia úlohou miestnej `test-login-oidc.js` a `test-login-native.js` Specs, ktoré vstúpia na `/login` a odhlásiť sa cez Taiga's vlastnou kontrolou."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Taiga redirects ``/`` to the public ``/discover`` showcase, which renders a bare Login link but not the OIDC entry point; only ``/login`` binds the SSO directive (see the note in ```files/playwright/_shared.js`` <./files/playwright/_shared.js>`__). The shared personas always enter at the site root, so they can never reach Taiga’s SSO button. Taiga’s AngularJS shell additionally exposes logout only through ``ng-click`` / ``tg-nav`` / ``ui-sref`` directives, which the generic in-app logout helper cannot activate. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the equivalent journeys are driven by the role-local ``test-login-oidc.js`` and ``test-login-native.js`` specs, which enter at ``/login`` and log out through Taiga’s own control."
msgstr "Taiga presmerovanie ``/`` pre verejnosť ``/discover`` Prezentácia, ktorá vytvára holý Prihlasovací odkaz, ale nie vstupný bod OIDC; ``/login`` zaväzuje smernicu SSO (pozri poznámku v ```files/playwright/_shared.js`` <./files/playwright/_shared.js>`__). The shared personas always enter at the site root, so they can never reach Taiga’s SSO button. Taiga’s AngularJS shell additionally exposes logout only through ``ng-click`` / ``tg-nav`` / ``ui-sref`` directives, which the generic in-app logout helper cannot activate. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the equivalent journeys are driven by the role-local ``test-login-oidc.js`` and ``test-login-native.js`` specs, which enter at ``/login`` a odhlásiť sa cez TaigaVlastní kontrolu."

