msgstr "Čarodejník Frappe je **obtok** pri prvom nasadení cez autobootstrap: `bench new-site` s `--admin-password`, `--db-name`, `--mariadb-user-host-login-scope=%` argumenty plus `bench install-app erpnext`, plus post-start API výzva z role `tasks/` označiť sprievodcu ako dokončeného (`frappe.db.set_default('setup_complete', '1')`). Čerstvé rozmiestniť pozemky priamo na ERPNext stôl."

msgid "The FreeLLMAPI role reads the unified key its dashboard issued and persists it in the token store for ``platform_administrator``; LiteLLM resolves it from there. The key never enters the inventory. If the store holds no key, setup fails and asks for a FreeLLMAPI deploy first. Configure the provider pool before the combined deploy, because the protocol checks need a working upstream. Provider credentials can remain in FreeLLMAPI’s existing declarative ``services.freellmapi.startup_config``; references to central inventory secrets avoid duplicating the credential values."
msgstr ""

msgid "The FreeLLMAPI role reads the unified key its dashboard issued and persists it in the token store for `platform_administrator`; LiteLLM resolves it from there. The key never enters the inventory. If the store holds no key, setup fails and asks for a FreeLLMAPI deploy first. Configure the provider pool before the combined deploy, because the protocol checks need a working upstream. Provider credentials can remain in FreeLLMAPI's existing declarative `services.freellmapi.startup_config`; references to central inventory secrets avoid duplicating the credential values."
msgstr ""

