# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The universal-logout service ([web-svc-logout](../../../../../roles/web-svc-logout/)), when attached to a deployment, injects JavaScript that auto-detects every logout control across the role tree and rewrites it to redirect through Keycloak's end-session endpoint. Persona scenarios therefore do NOT branch on whether universal-logout is active: they always click the role's own logout button. The injected JS handles the redirect when active, the click clears the local session when not, and the post-click assertion (`assertUnauthenticatedLanding`) is identical in both cases."
msgstr "Univerzálna odhlasovacia služba ([web-svc-logout](../../../../../roles/web-svc-logout/)), keď je pripojený k nasadeniu, vstrekuje JavaScript, ktorý auto-detektuje každé odhlásenie kontrolu cez rolový strom a prepisuje ju presmerovať cez Keycloak's koncovým ukazovateľom. Persona scenáre preto NIE sú vetvy o tom, či univerzálny logout je aktívny: vždy kliknite na role vlastné logout tlačidlo. Vpichnutý JS zvládne presmerovanie pri aktivovaní, kliknutím odstráni miestne sedenie, ak nie, a tvrdenie po kliknutí (`assertUnauthenticatedLanding`) je v oboch prípadoch totožný."

msgid "The updater rewrites both lines together. A URL that does not carry the pin fails `tests/lint/ansible/services/test_version_keys.py`."
msgstr ""

msgid "The upstream `oauth2-proxy` MUST set `X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username` and `X-Forwarded-Email` on every request that reaches the broker. The broker keys every account on `X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username` alone and never reads `X-Forwarded-User`, which carries the e-mail address. Without `X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username`, the broker returns HTTP 401, there is no anonymous fallback by design."
msgstr ""

msgid "The upstream authentication between its own services stays enabled: `RELAY_SHARED_SECRET`, `REDIS_PASSWORD`, `REDIS_TOKEN` and `WM_SESSION_SECRET` are generated through [`meta/secrets.yml`](./meta/secrets.yml). `I_UNDERSTAND_THIS_DISABLES_AUTH` and `ALLOW_UNAUTHENTICATED_RELAY` are never set. Only the `worldmonitor` HTTP port is published, bound to the platform bind host; Redis, the REST bridge and the relay stay on the role network."
msgstr ""

msgid "The upstream authentication between its own services stays enabled: ``RELAY_SHARED_SECRET``, ``REDIS_PASSWORD``, ``REDIS_TOKEN`` and ``WM_SESSION_SECRET`` are generated through ```meta/secrets.yml`` <./meta/secrets.yml>`__. ``I_UNDERSTAND_THIS_DISABLES_AUTH`` and ``ALLOW_UNAUTHENTICATED_RELAY`` are never set. Only the ``worldmonitor`` HTTP port is published, bound to the platform bind host; Redis, the REST bridge and the relay stay on the role network."
