msgid "The vhost hands them to ``proxy_pass``, which reaches the service over the overlay in swarm. A role with ``meta/domains.yml`` proxies to its entity's ``http`` port unless told otherwise; every ``http_port``, ``websocket_port``, ``sso_open_location_http_port`` and ``local_port=`` value adds the local ports it reads, through the role's variables. A value that reads another role's port, as web-app-litellm reads svc-ai-litellm's, credits that role."
