msgid "The vhost has no root document: `GET /` answers 403 with the built-in page of the proxy, and `meta/server.yml` accepts that status. Cause: no role writes an `index.html` into the webroot and `location /` has no `autoindex`. Options: ship an index document that links the documents the webroot holds, redirect `/` to the start page of the platform, or keep the 403."
