# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role extracts the project version from the local ``pyproject.toml`` (using ``playbook_dir``) and writes it as a system-wide environment variable into ``/etc/environment`` on the managed host."
msgstr "Táto Ansible role extrahuje verziu projektu z miestnej ``pyproject.toml`` (použitie ``playbook_dir``) a píše ju ako celosystémovú premennú prostredia do ``/etc/environment`` na riadenom hostiteľovi."

