msgid "This Ansible role manages the configuration of `systemd-journald` on target hosts."
msgstr "Táto Ansible role riadi konfiguráciu `systemd-journald` na cieľových hostiteľov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role manages the system locale configuration by deploying ``locale.gen`` and ``locale.conf``, then generating the requested locales."
msgstr "Táto Ansible role riadi konfiguráciu systému lokalizovať nasadenie ``locale.gen`` a ``locale.conf``, potom generovanie požadované locales."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role manages the system locale configuration by deploying `locale.gen` and `locale.conf`, then generating the requested locales."
