# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys n8n Community Edition using the upstream ``docker.n8n.io/n8nio/n8n`` image backed by a PostgreSQL database (consumed from the central ``svc-db-postgres`` via ``sys-stk-full``). Authentication is handled by an **oauth2-proxy** sidecar (Keycloak OIDC) in V1, or left to n8n’s own user-management UI in V2. n8n Community Edition does not support LDAP — it is gated behind n8n’s Enterprise license (``ldap.controller.ee.js`` is not registered in CE) — so no LDAP variant is offered. Credentials stored inside n8n are encrypted at rest with a stable ``N8N_ENCRYPTION_KEY``."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys n8n Community Edition using the upstream `docker.n8n.io/n8nio/n8n` image backed by a PostgreSQL database (consumed from the central `svc-db-postgres` via `sys-stk-full`). Authentication is handled by an **oauth2-proxy** sidecar (Keycloak OIDC) in V1, or left to n8n's own user-management UI in V2. n8n Community Edition does not support LDAP — it is gated behind n8n's Enterprise license (`ldap.controller.ee.js` is not registered in CE) — so no LDAP variant is offered. Credentials stored inside n8n are encrypted at rest with a stable `N8N_ENCRYPTION_KEY`."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys no AI surface and declares no ``litellm`` service, because EspoCRM’s open-source distribution does not ship one. At the pinned version ``10.0.4``, ``application/Espo/Modules`` contains only ``Crm``, ``application/Espo/Resources/metadata/app/config.json`` declares no AI key, and the release ZIP the image is built from leaves ``custom/Espo/Modules`` empty. The AI features (Summary, Intelligent Paste, AI Email Composer, AI formula functions) live exclusively in the commercial `Intelligence extension <https://www.espocrm.com/extensions/intelligence/>`__, which is closed source, requires a purchased license, and is published in no ``espocrm`` GitHub repository. Bumping the version does not change this: the extension is documented as requiring EspoCRM 10.0.3 or greater, so newer cores stay hosts for it rather than absorbing it."
msgstr "Táto rola rozmiestňuje žiadny povrch AI a deklaruje nie ``litellm`` služby, pretože EspoCRMDistribúcia open-source neponúka žiadnu. Na pripnutej verzii ``10.0.4``, ``application/Espo/Modules`` obsahuje len ``Crm``, ``application/Espo/Resources/metadata/app/config.json`` deklaruje žiadny AI kľúč, a vydanie ZIP obraz je postavený z listov ``custom/Espo/Modules`` prázdny. Vlastnosti UI (Súhrn, Inteligentná pasta, AI Email Composer, funkcie AI vzorca) žiť výlučne v obchode `Intelligence extension <https://www.espocrm.com/extensions/intelligence/>`__, ktorý je uzavretý zdroj, vyžaduje zakúpenú licenciu, a je zverejnený v ``espocrm`` GitHub úložisko. Bumping verzia nemení toto: rozšírenie je zdokumentované ako vyžaduje EspoCRM 10.0.3 alebo väčšie, takže novšie jadrá zostávajú hostiteľmi pre neho, a nie absorbovať."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys no AI surface and declares no `litellm` service, because EspoCRM's open-source distribution does not ship one. At the pinned version `10.0.4`, `application/Espo/Modules` contains only `Crm`, `application/Espo/Resources/metadata/app/config.json` declares no AI key, and the release ZIP the image is built from leaves `custom/Espo/Modules` empty. The AI features (Summary, Intelligent Paste, AI Email Composer, AI formula functions) live exclusively in the commercial [Intelligence extension](https://www.espocrm.com/extensions/intelligence/), which is closed source, requires a purchased license, and is published in no `espocrm` GitHub repository. Bumping the version does not change this: the extension is documented as requiring EspoCRM 10.0.3 or greater, so newer cores stay hosts for it rather than absorbing it."
msgstr "Táto rola rozmiestňuje žiadny povrch AI a deklaruje nie `litellm` služby, pretože EspoCRMDistribúcia open-source neponúka žiadnu. Na pripnutej verzii `10.0.4`, `application/Espo/Modules` obsahuje len `Crm`, `application/Espo/Resources/metadata/app/config.json` deklaruje žiadny AI kľúč, a vydanie ZIP obraz je postavený z listov `custom/Espo/Modules` prázdny. Vlastnosti UI (Súhrn, Inteligentná pasta, AI Email Composer, funkcie AI vzorca) žiť výlučne v obchode [Rozšírenie spravodajskej služby](https://www.espocrm.com/extensions/intelligence/), ktorý je uzavretý zdroj, vyžaduje zakúpenú licenciu, a je zverejnený v `espocrm` GitHub úložisko. Bumping verzia nemení toto: rozšírenie je zdokumentované ako vyžaduje EspoCRM 10.0.3 alebo väčšie, takže novšie jadrá zostávajú hostiteľmi pre neho, a nie absorbovať."

msgid "This role deploys no third-party application, so the licence above is the only one that applies."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role deploys nothing. Its ``meta/services.yml`` pins the image and release each distribution’s development environment boots from, keyed by the distribution id of `meta/distros.yml <../../meta/distros.yml>`__, and ``utils/distros.py`` reads the workspace matrix from it. Because the pins live in a role’s ``meta/services.yml``, the docker updater proposes new releases as pull requests and the image mirror and the vulnerability scan cover them like every other role image. ``follow: latest`` holds a pin to the release the ``latest`` tag points at, so Ubuntu moves between LTS releases only and Fedora skips rawhide. Arch stays rolling, and CentOS Stream tags carry no number the updater can order, so its next stream is a manual change."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role deploys nothing. Its `meta/services.yml` pins the image and release each distribution's development environment boots from, keyed by the distribution id of [meta/distros.yml](../../meta/distros.yml), and `utils/distros.py` reads the workspace matrix from it. Because the pins live in a role's `meta/services.yml`, the docker updater proposes new releases as pull requests and the image mirror and the vulnerability scan cover them like every other role image. `follow: latest` holds a pin to the release the `latest` tag points at, so Ubuntu moves between LTS releases only and Fedora skips rawhide. Arch stays rolling, and CentOS Stream tags carry no number the updater can order, so its next stream is a manual change."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys the LiteLLM admin UI as the browser-facing entry point of the headless LiteLLM Gateway. It runs in host mode and starts no container of its own: it claims a canonical domain, terminates TLS, applies the platform Content-Security-Policy, and reverse-proxies that domain to the local HTTP port the gateway publishes. Visitors sign in with the gateway's own UI credentials."
msgstr "Táto úloha nasadzuje LiteLLM admin UI ako prehliadač orientovaný vstupný bod bezhlavého LiteLLM Gateway. Funguje v hostiteľskom režime a nezačína žiadnu nádobu svojho vlastného: tvrdí, že kanonická doména, ukončí TLS, uplatňuje platformu Content-Bezpečnosť-Politika, a reverzné-proxies, že doména do miestneho HTTP portu brána publikuje. Návštevníci sa prihlásia s vlastnými UI údajmi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys the LiteLLM admin UI as the browser-facing entry point of the headless LiteLLM Gateway. It runs in host mode and starts no container of its own: it claims a canonical domain, terminates TLS, applies the platform Content-Security-Policy, and reverse-proxies that domain to the local HTTP port the gateway publishes. Visitors sign in with the gateway’s own UI credentials."
msgstr "Táto úloha nasadzuje LiteLLM admin UI ako prehliadač orientovaný vstupný bod bezhlavého LiteLLM Gateway. Funguje v hostiteľskom režime a nezačína žiadnu nádobu svojho vlastného: tvrdí, že kanonická doména, ukončí TLS, uplatňuje platformu Content-Bezpečnosť-Politika, a reverzné-proxies, že doména do miestneho HTTP portu brána publikuje. Návštevníci sa prihlásiť s bránou a vlastné UI poverenia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys the OpenTalk stack using Docker Compose and exposes the web frontend at ``open.talk.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}`` through the central reverse proxy. It runs the Rust controller, the LiveKit WebRTC media server, the React web frontend, a dedicated Redis, a dedicated MinIO bucket for controller assets, a RabbitMQ broker, and the OpenTalk recorder for meeting MP4 archives. The deployment integrates with the shared Keycloak realm via OIDC and reuses ``svc-db-postgres`` and ``web-svc-coturn`` for relational data and STUN/TURN. For identity wiring details see `IAM.md <docs/IAM.md>`__ and `LDAP.md <docs/LDAP.md>`__."
msgstr "Táto úloha rozširuje OpenTalk použitie stohu Docker Compose a odhaľuje web frontend v ``open.talk.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}`` prostredníctvom centrálnej reverznej proxy. Spúšťa regulátor Rust, mediálny server LiveKit WebRTC, webový frontend React, venovaný Redis, MinIO Skupina pre aktíva regulátora, a RabbitMQ sprostredkovateľ a OpenTalk Zapisovač stretnutia MP4 archívy. Nasadenie sa integruje so spoločným Keycloak ríša cez OIDC a opätovné použitie ``svc-db-postgres`` a ``web-svc-coturn`` pre relačné údaje a STUN/TURN. Podrobnosti o prepojení totožnosti nájdete na: `IAM.md <docs/IAM.md>`__ a `LDAP.md <docs/LDAP.md>`__."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys the OpenTalk stack using Docker Compose and exposes the web frontend at `open.talk.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}` through the central reverse proxy. It runs the Rust controller, the LiveKit WebRTC media server, the React web frontend, a dedicated Redis, a dedicated MinIO bucket for controller assets, a RabbitMQ broker, and the OpenTalk recorder for meeting MP4 archives. The deployment integrates with the shared Keycloak realm via OIDC and reuses `svc-db-postgres` and `web-svc-coturn` for relational data and STUN/TURN. For identity wiring details see [IAM.md](docs/IAM.md) and [LDAP.md](docs/LDAP.md)."
msgstr "Táto úloha rozširuje OpenTalk použitie stohu Docker Compose a odhaľuje web frontend v `open.talk.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}` prostredníctvom centrálnej reverznej proxy. Spúšťa regulátor Rust, mediálny server LiveKit WebRTC, webový frontend React, venovaný Redis, MinIO Skupina pre aktíva regulátora, a RabbitMQ sprostredkovateľ a OpenTalk Zapisovač stretnutia MP4 archívy. Nasadenie sa integruje so spoločným Keycloak ríša cez OIDC a opätovné použitie `svc-db-postgres` a `web-svc-coturn` pre relačné údaje a STUN/TURN. Podrobnosti o prepojení totožnosti nájdete na: [IAM.md](docs/IAM.md) a [LDAP.md](docs/LDAP.md)."

msgid "This role deploys the Python pull script that talks to each remote provider, installs the systemd service that drives it on the configured schedule (`SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_REMOTE_TO_LOCAL`), and first waits for the rest of the manipulation group via `sys-lock`, up to `SYS_TIMEOUT_BACKUP_SERVICES`. The remote side must expose a chrooted SSH/SFTP endpoint that publishes its backup tree: deploy [user-backup](../user-backup/) for the chrooted pull account and [sys-ctl-cln-bkps](../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/) to keep the published tree bounded."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role deploys the Python pull script that talks to each remote provider, installs the systemd service that drives it on the configured schedule (``SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_REMOTE_TO_LOCAL``), and first waits for the rest of the manipulation group via ``sys-lock``, up to ``SYS_TIMEOUT_BACKUP_SERVICES``. The remote side must expose a chrooted SSH/SFTP endpoint that publishes its backup tree: deploy `user-backup <../user-backup/>`__ for the chrooted pull account and `sys-ctl-cln-bkps <../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/>`__ to keep the published tree bounded."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role deploys the [Meta Infinite Graph](https://github.com/infinito-nexus/meta), a browsable graph of every Infinito.Nexus role and the dependencies between them. It is served as a pre-rendered static site from a project-owned container image."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role deploys the `Meta Infinite Graph <https://github.com/infinito-nexus/meta>`__, a browsable graph of every Infinito.Nexus role and the dependencies between them. It is served as a pre-rendered static site from a project-owned container image."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys the broker together with a container-API socket proxy in Compose and Swarm deployments. Open WebUI reaches the broker as a second OpenAI connection and forwards the caller's identity. The broker checks the caller's Keycloak group, creates or starts that caller's agent under the isolating runtime, forwards the request to it and streams the answer back. Agents reach their model only through the broker, which relays each call to the shared LiteLLM gateway with its own key and tags it with the owner."
msgstr "Táto úloha rozmiestňuje makléra spolu s kontajnerom-API soket proxy v Compose and Swarm nasadení. Otvoriť WebUI dosiahne makléra ako druhý OpenAI pripojenie a preposiela totožnosť volajúceho. Sprostredkovateľ kontroluje volajúceho Keycloak skupina, vytvorí alebo začne, že agent volajúceho pod izolujúcim časom beží, postúpi žiadosť k nemu a pošle odpoveď späť. Agenti dosiahnu svoj model iba prostredníctvom makléra, ktorý prenáša každý hovor do zdieľanej brány LiteLLM s vlastným kľúčom a označí ho s vlastníkom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys the broker together with a container-API socket proxy in Compose and Swarm deployments. Open WebUI reaches the broker as a second OpenAI connection and forwards the caller’s identity. The broker checks the caller’s Keycloak group, creates or starts that caller’s agent under the isolating runtime, forwards the request to it and streams the answer back. Agents reach their model only through the broker, which relays each call to the shared LiteLLM gateway with its own key and tags it with the owner."
msgstr "Táto úloha rozmiestňuje makléra spolu s kontajnerom-API soket proxy v Compose and Swarm nasadení. Otvoriť WebUI dosiahne makléra ako druhý OpenAI pripojenie a zasiela volajúceho identity. Sprostredkovateľ kontroluje volajúceho Keycloak skupina, vytvára alebo začína, že volajúci agent pod izolujúcim čas beží, zasiela žiadosť k nemu a prúdi odpoveď späť. Agenti dosiahnu svoj model iba prostredníctvom makléra, ktorý prenáša každý hovor do zdieľanej brány LiteLLM s vlastným kľúčom a označí ho s vlastníkom."

msgid "This role deploys the fixture with Docker Compose behind the standard front proxy, building a small custom nginx image from the tree under ``files/app``. The role refuses to run unless the inventory sets ``AGENT_FIXTURE_BUNDLE: true``; only the agents test bundle (``inventories/bundles/servers/agents``) sets that flag, so the fixture never comes up on a real host and any other inventory fails hard at the first task."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role deploys the fixture with Docker Compose behind the standard front proxy, building a small custom nginx image from the tree under `files/app`. The role refuses to run unless the inventory sets `AGENT_FIXTURE_BUNDLE: true`; only the agents test bundle (`inventories/bundles/servers/agents`) sets that flag, so the fixture never comes up on a real host and any other inventory fails hard at the first task."
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "This role deploys the official ``jitsi/{web,prosody,jicofo,jvb}`` images as a single-domain Jitsi Meet stack. With SSO enabled, the oauth2-proxy gate admits every realm user to the vhost. With ``services.keycloak_adapter.enabled`` also true, the role builds the `nordeck jitsi-keycloak-adapter <https://github.com/nordeck/jitsi-keycloak-adapter>`__ (Apache-2.0) and switches prosody to ``AUTH_TYPE=jwt``. In the LDAP-only variant, prosody uses the image’s own ``AUTH_TYPE=ldap`` path (``mod_auth_cyrus`` against the saslauthd the ``LDAP_*`` variables of `env.j2 <./templates/env.j2>`__ configure). The web container sits behind the central openresty reverse proxy at ``meet.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}``; the media plane (jvb) publishes UDP ``10000/udp`` on the host."
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "This role deploys the official `jitsi/{web,prosody,jicofo,jvb}` images as a single-domain Jitsi Meet stack. With SSO enabled, the oauth2-proxy gate admits every realm user to the vhost. With `services.keycloak_adapter.enabled` also true, the role builds the [nordeck jitsi-keycloak-adapter](https://github.com/nordeck/jitsi-keycloak-adapter) (Apache-2.0) and switches prosody to `AUTH_TYPE=jwt`. In the LDAP-only variant, prosody uses the image's own `AUTH_TYPE=ldap` path (`mod_auth_cyrus` against the saslauthd the `LDAP_*` variables of [env.j2](./templates/env.j2) configure). The web container sits behind the central openresty reverse proxy at `meet.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}`; the media plane (jvb) publishes UDP `10000/udp` on the host."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role deploys the single-node Wazuh stack (``wazuh.manager``, ``wazuh.indexer``, ``wazuh.dashboard``) with Docker Compose or Docker Swarm. A one-shot ``wazuh-certs-generator`` job creates the internal TLS material before the manager and the indexer start. The indexer is the stack’s own datastore and holds the OpenSearch security configuration, so the role needs no shared database. Agent enrollment is not part of this role: the agent ports are declared in `services.yml <./meta/services.yml>`__ but not published. The manager’s vulnerability detection data (``/var/ossec/queue/vd``, volume ``wazuh_manager_vd``) is deliberately not backed up. The manager downloads it again after a restore, which can take a long time. This matters once agents are enrolled."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role deploys the single-node Wazuh stack (`wazuh.manager`, `wazuh.indexer`, `wazuh.dashboard`) with Docker Compose or Docker Swarm. A one-shot `wazuh-certs-generator` job creates the internal TLS material before the manager and the indexer start. The indexer is the stack's own datastore and holds the OpenSearch security configuration, so the role needs no shared database. Agent enrollment is not part of this role: the agent ports are declared in [services.yml](./meta/services.yml) but not published. The manager's vulnerability detection data (`/var/ossec/queue/vd`, volume `wazuh_manager_vd`) is deliberately not backed up. The manager downloads it again after a restore, which can take a long time. This matters once agents are enrolled."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role deploys the upstream render server image, which serves the editor at `/` and the render queue at `/renders/`. The server puts everything except its login page behind its own login form. When Keycloak is part of the deployment, the oauth2 gate additionally guards the whole domain, so only signed-in platform users reach that form."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role deploys the upstream render server image, which serves the editor at ``/`` and the render queue at ``/renders/``. The server puts everything except its login page behind its own login form. When Keycloak is part of the deployment, the oauth2 gate additionally guards the whole domain, so only signed-in platform users reach that form."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role detects unused **anonymous Docker volumes** that are not bound to any running container."
msgstr "Táto rola detekuje nepoužité **anonymné objemy Docker** ktoré nie sú viazané na žiadny jazdný kontajner."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role detects unused **anonymous Docker volumes** that are not bound to any running container.   It can optionally exclude specific volumes from the check using a configurable whitelist."
msgstr "Táto rola detekuje nepoužité **anonymné objemy Docker** ktoré nie sú viazané na žiadny jazdný kontajner. Z kontroly môže voliteľne vylúčiť konkrétne objemy pomocou konfigurovateľného bieleho zoznamu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role disk-space usage monitor; alerts when usage exceeds threshold."
msgstr "Táto rola používanie disk-priestor monitor; upozornenia, keď používanie presahuje prah."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role does **not** sign leaf certificates. It only provisions the Root CA."
msgstr "Táto úloha áno **nie** osvedčenia podpisového listu. Iba rezervuje koreňovú CA."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role does NOT configure OIDC against ``web-app-keycloak``, LDAP against ``svc-db-openldap``, or any role-claim / LDAP-group RBAC mapping. Bridgy Fed authenticates users via their fediverse or atproto credentials at the source platform, not via local accounts. There is no local user table to bind an external IdP to, and no in-app authorisation tier to map a Keycloak role or LDAP group onto. Placing Bridgy Fed behind ``web-app-keycloak``\\ ’s SSO-proxy sidecar would break inbound federation traffic and MUST NOT be done. This SSO and RBAC exception is documented per `lifecycle.md <../../docs/contributing/design/role/services/lifecycle.md>`__."
msgstr "Táto úloha NOT konfiguruje OIDC proti ``web-app-keycloak``, LDAP proti ``svc-db-openldap``, alebo akékoľvek role-claim / LDAP-skupina RBAC mapovanie. Bridgy Fed autentifikuje užívateľov prostredníctvom ich fediverzných alebo atproto osvedčení na zdrojovej platforme, nie prostredníctvom miestnych účtov. Neexistuje žiadna miestna používateľská tabuľka, ktorá by zaväzovala externé IdP k mape, a žiadna úroveň povolenia v aplikácii Keycloak rola alebo LDAP skupina na. Umiestnenie Bridgy Fed za ``web-app-keycloak``\\ Táto SSO a RBAC výnimka je zdokumentovaná `lifecycle.md <../../docs/contributing/design/role/services/lifecycle.md>`__."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role does NOT configure OIDC against `web-app-keycloak`, LDAP against `svc-db-openldap`, or any role-claim / LDAP-group RBAC mapping. Bridgy Fed authenticates users via their fediverse or atproto credentials at the source platform, not via local accounts. There is no local user table to bind an external IdP to, and no in-app authorisation tier to map a Keycloak role or LDAP group onto. Placing Bridgy Fed behind `web-app-keycloak`'s SSO-proxy sidecar would break inbound federation traffic and MUST NOT be done. This SSO and RBAC exception is documented per [lifecycle.md](../../docs/contributing/design/role/services/lifecycle.md)."
msgstr "Táto úloha NOT konfiguruje OIDC proti `web-app-keycloak`, LDAP proti `svc-db-openldap`, alebo akékoľvek role-claim / LDAP-skupina RBAC mapovanie. Bridgy Fed autentifikuje užívateľov prostredníctvom ich fediverzných alebo atproto osvedčení na zdrojovej platforme, nie prostredníctvom miestnych účtov. Neexistuje žiadna miestna používateľská tabuľka, ktorá by zaväzovala externé IdP k mape, a žiadna úroveň povolenia v aplikácii Keycloak rola alebo LDAP skupina na. Umiestnenie Bridgy Fed za `web-app-keycloak`'s SSO-proxy sidecar by zlomiť prichádzajúce federácie dopravy a nesmie byť vykonané. Táto SSO a RBAC výnimka je zdokumentovaná [lifecycle.md](../../docs/contributing/design/role/services/lifecycle.md)."

msgid "This role does not configure OIDC against ``web-app-keycloak`` or LDAP against ``svc-db-openldap``. atmo has no local accounts: users sign in with AT Protocol OAuth at their own PDS, and the PDS of ``web-app-bluesky`` is where the platform’s accounts live. Moderation rights are granted to DIDs listed in ``services.atmo.moderator_dids``, not to an in-app role, so there is no Keycloak group to map either. Placing atmo behind the SSO proxy would break the OAuth callbacks and the public client metadata the PDS fetches."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role does not configure OIDC against `web-app-keycloak` or LDAP against `svc-db-openldap`. atmo has no local accounts: users sign in with AT Protocol OAuth at their own PDS, and the PDS of `web-app-bluesky` is where the platform's accounts live. Moderation rights are granted to DIDs listed in `services.atmo.moderator_dids`, not to an in-app role, so there is no Keycloak group to map either. Placing atmo behind the SSO proxy would break the OAuth callbacks and the public client metadata the PDS fetches."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role enhances your NGINX configuration by conditionally injecting global Matomo tracking and theming elements into your HTML responses. It uses NGINX sub-filters to seamlessly add tracking scripts and CSS links to your web pages."
msgstr "Táto úloha zvyšuje vašu konfiguráciu NGINX podmienečným vstreknutím globálneho Matomo sledovanie a iming prvkov do vašich HTML odpovedí. Používa NGINX podfiltre na bezproblémové pridávanie sledovacích skriptov a CSS odkazy na vaše webové stránky."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role ensures OpenSSL is installed once as a shared host dependency for roles that invoke the ``openssl`` CLI."
msgstr "Táto úloha zaisťuje, že OpenSSL je nainštalovaný raz ako spoločná závislosť hostiteľa na rolách, ktoré vyvolávajú ``openssl`` CLI."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role ensures OpenSSL is installed once as a shared host dependency for roles that invoke the `openssl` CLI."
msgstr "Táto úloha zaisťuje, že OpenSSL je nainštalovaný raz ako spoločná závislosť hostiteľa na rolách, ktoré vyvolávajú `openssl` CLI."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role ensures that GNU Make is installed on the target system. It is intended for environments where automated build processes or custom software compilation are required."
msgstr "Táto úloha zabezpečuje, že GNU Make je nainštalovaný na cieľovom systéme. Je určený pre prostredia, kde sa vyžadujú automatizované procesy výstavby alebo vlastné spracovanie softvéru."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role executes common tasks for user environment configuration."
msgstr "Táto úloha vykonáva spoločné úlohy pre konfiguráciu prostredia užívateľa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role extends sys-stk-backend by adding an HTTP reverse proxy via sys-stk-front-proxy."
msgstr "Táto úloha sa rozširuje sys-stk-backend pridaním HTTP reverzného proxy cez sys-stk-front-proxy."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role extracts the local pyproject.toml version and writes it as an environment variable in /etc/environment on the target host."
msgstr "Táto úloha vylučuje miestne pyproject.toml verzia a píše ju ako premennú prostredia v /etc/environment na cieľovom hostiteľovi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role focuses on **safe automation and scheduling**, while the linked project contains the actual cleanup implementation."
msgstr "Táto úloha sa zameriava na **bezpečná automatizácia a plánovanie**, zatiaľ čo prepojený projekt obsahuje skutočnú realizáciu čistenia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role force-installs the following Chromium browser extensions via managed Enterprise Policies. They are declared in ``meta/addons/`` and rendered into the CRX install list."
msgstr "Táto úloha inštaluje nasledujúce Chromium rozšírenie prehliadača prostredníctvom riadených Enterprise Policies. Sú deklarované v ``meta/addons/`` a prevedená do zoznamu inštalácií CRX."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role force-installs the following Chromium browser extensions via managed Enterprise Policies. They are declared in `meta/addons/` and rendered into the CRX install list."
msgstr "Táto úloha inštaluje nasledujúce Chromium rozšírenie prehliadača prostredníctvom riadených Enterprise Policies. Sú deklarované v `meta/addons/` a prevedená do zoznamu inštalácií CRX."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role frees disk space by executing a script that cleans up temporary files, clears package caches, and optionally cleans up backup directories and Docker resources when disk usage exceeds a specified threshold."
msgstr "Táto úloha oslobodzuje miesto na disku vykonaním skriptu, ktorý čistí dočasné súbory, čistí vyrovnávaciu pamäť balíkov a prípadne čistí záložné adresáre a Docker zdroje, keď používanie disku prekročí stanovenú hranicu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role front bootstrap for web apps: HTTPS base, optional Cloudflare setup, and handler wiring."
msgstr "Táto rola predné bootstrap pre webové aplikácie: HTTPS základne, voliteľné Cloudflare nastavenie, a rukoväť elektroinštalácie."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role generic role to manage reverse DNS (PTR) for Hetzner Cloud resources (server, primary_ip, floating_ip, load_balancer)."
msgstr "Táto úloha všeobecná úloha pre riadenie reverznej DNS (PTR) pre zdroje spoločnosti Hetzner Cloud (server, primary_ip, floating_ip, load_balancer)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role gives every other role one place to put packet filter rules. A role that needs them writes ``templates/nftables.conf.j2`` declaring its own nftables table and includes this role; the fragment is rendered to ``/etc/nftables.d/<role>.conf``, checked, loaded, and read back, so a deploy fails rather than quietly leaving a gap. Deployed on its own, the role installs nftables, the ruleset that loads every fragment, and the ``nftables.service`` that replays them at boot."
msgstr "Táto úloha dáva každej ďalšej úlohe jedno miesto pre uvedenie pravidiel pakety filtra. Úloha, ktorá ich potrebuje písať ``templates/nftables.conf.j2`` vyhlásenie svojej vlastnej tabuľky nftables a zahŕňa túto úlohu; fragment sa prevedie do ``/etc/nftables.d/<role>.conf``, skontrolované, naložené, a čítať späť, takže rozmiestnenie zlyhá skôr ako ticho zanechá medzeru. Nasadenie na vlastnú päsť, rola inštaluje nftables, pravidlá, ktoré načíta každý fragment, a ``nftables.service`` To ich znovu prehráva."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role gives every other role one place to put packet filter rules. A role that needs them writes `templates/nftables.conf.j2` declaring its own nftables table and includes this role; the fragment is rendered to `/etc/nftables.d/<role>.conf`, checked, loaded, and read back, so a deploy fails rather than quietly leaving a gap. Deployed on its own, the role installs nftables, the ruleset that loads every fragment, and the `nftables.service` that replays them at boot."
msgstr "Táto úloha dáva každej ďalšej úlohe jedno miesto pre uvedenie pravidiel pakety filtra. Úloha, ktorá ich potrebuje písať `templates/nftables.conf.j2` vyhlásenie svojej vlastnej tabuľky nftables a zahŕňa túto úlohu; fragment sa prevedie do `/etc/nftables.d/<role>.conf`, skontrolované, naložené, a čítať späť, takže rozmiestnenie zlyhá skôr ako ticho zanechá medzeru. Nasadenie na vlastnú päsť, rola inštaluje nftables, pravidlá, ktoré načíta každý fragment, a `nftables.service` To ich znovu prehráva."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role guarantees the workstation account before any desktop role writes for it."
msgstr "Táto úloha zaručuje účet pracovnej stanice pred každou pracovnou úlohou za ňu píše."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role health-check for Btrfs filesystems, alerts on any device error counters."
msgstr "Táto úloha zdravotnej kontroly pre súborové systémy Btrfs, upozornenia na akékoľvek počítadlá chýb zariadenia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role injects Matomo analytics tracking code and noscript image tracker into Nginx-served HTML pages."
msgstr "Táto rola dodáva injekciu Matomo analytické sledovacie kód a notscript obrazu tracker do Nginx-served HTML stránok."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role injects a JS snippet into HTML to notify parent windows of iframe location changes and force external links to new tabs."
msgstr "Táto rola vstrekuje JS odstrihnutie do HTML, aby upozornila rodičovské okná iframe umiestnenia zmeny a vynútiť externé odkazy na nové karty."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role injects a catcher that intercepts all logout elements in HTML pages served by NGINX and redirects them to a centralized logout endpoint via JavaScript."
msgstr "Táto rola vloží catcher, ktorý zachytí všetky odhlasovacie prvky v HTML stránkach, ktoré podáva NGINX a presmeruje ich do centralizovaného odhlasovacieho cieľa cez JavaScript."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role injects a custom JavaScript snippet into Nginx-served HTML responses via sub_filter."
msgstr "Táto rola vstrekuje vlastný JavaScript odstrihnutie do Nginx-served HTML odpovedí cez sub_filter."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs **GNOME Terminal**, the official terminal emulator for the GNOME desktop environment. GNOME Terminal provides a modern, feature-rich command-line interface for users on Arch Linux."
msgstr "Táto úloha nainštaluje **GNOME Terminal**, oficiálny emulátor terminálu pre pracovné prostredie GNOME. GNOME Terminal poskytuje moderné, funkcie-bohaté príkazové-line rozhranie pre užívateľov na Arch Linux."

msgid "This role installs Blender on a workstation and connects it to the coding agents the same host deploys, so a model can drive the scene instead of only describing it."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs CA trust injection assets for compose (wrapper + inject script) and validates CA cert presence."
msgstr "Táto úloha nainštaluje aktíva CA trustovej injekcie pre zostavenie (balenie + podanie skriptu) a potvrdzuje prítomnosť certifikátu CA."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs Epson multifunction printer drivers and scanning utilities (escpr, imagescan) via Pacman and AUR on Arch Linux."
msgstr "Táto rola inštaluje multifunkčné ovládače tlačiarní Epson a skenovacie zariadenia (escpr, imagescan) cez Pacman a AUR na Arch Linux."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs GNOME Terminal on Arch Linux, providing a modern terminal emulator for the GNOME desktop environment."
msgstr "Táto úloha nainštaluje GNOME Terminal na Arch Linux, poskytuje moderný terminál emulátor pre GNOME desktop prostredia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs Git and configures it using a custom git-configurator for personal computers."
msgstr "Táto úloha nainštaluje Git a konfiguruje ho pomocou vlastného git-konfigurátora pre osobné počítače."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs LibreOffice along with Liberation fonts and language packages on Arch Linux systems for a complete office suite experience."
msgstr "Táto úloha nainštaluje LibreOffice spolu s fontami na oslobodenie a jazykovými balíkmi na systémoch Arch Linux pre kompletný zážitok z kancelárskych apartmánov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs LibreOffice on Arch Linux systems using the Pacman package manager. In addition, it installs the Liberation fonts (ttf-liberation) and language packs corresponding to your chosen LibreOffice flavor. LibreOffice is a powerful and free office suite that provides a comprehensive set of tools for document processing, spreadsheets, presentations, and more."
msgstr "Táto úloha nainštaluje LibreOffice na systémoch Arch Linux pomocou správcu balíkov Pacman. Okrem toho nainštaluje písma oslobodenia (ttf-manažment) a jazykové balíčky zodpovedajúce vašej zvolenej LibreOffice chuť. LibreOffice je výkonný a bezplatný kancelársky apartmán, ktorý poskytuje komplexnú sadu nástrojov na spracovanie dokumentov, tabuliek, prezentácií a ďalších."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs [caffeine-ng](https://codeberg.org/WhyNotHugo/caffeine-ng), a utility that prevents your GNOME desktop from entering sleep mode or activating the screensaver automatically. It also ensures that caffeine-ng is set to autostart at user login."
msgstr "Táto úloha nainštaluje [kofeín-ng](https://codeberg.org/WhyNotHugo/caffeine-ng), nástroj, ktorý zabraňuje GNOME desktopu vstúpiť do režimu spánku alebo automaticky aktivovať šetrič obrazovky. To tiež zabezpečuje, že kofeín-ng je nastavená na automatické štartovanie pri prihlásení užívateľa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs `caffeine-ng <https://codeberg.org/WhyNotHugo/caffeine-ng>`__, a utility that prevents your GNOME desktop from entering sleep mode or activating the screensaver automatically. It also ensures that caffeine-ng is set to autostart at user login."
msgstr "Táto úloha nainštaluje `caffeine-ng <https://codeberg.org/WhyNotHugo/caffeine-ng>`__, nástroj, ktorý zabraňuje GNOME desktopu vstúpiť do režimu spánku alebo automaticky aktivovať šetrič obrazovky. To tiež zabezpečuje, že kofeín-ng je nastavená na automatické štartovanie pri prihlásení užívateľa."

msgid "This role installs a systemd service and a daily timer that run the ``garbage_collector.sh`` of every application role deployed on the host in ``routine`` mode. Application roles register their script through ``tasks/utils/install.yml``, which writes one entry per application id below ``DIR_GARBAGE_COLLECTOR_MANIFESTS``. The `disc space cleaner <../sys-ctl-cln-disc-space/README.md>`__ runs the same dispatcher in ``pressure`` mode when a disk crosses its threshold. The destructor stage drops the entries of roles no longer active on the host through ``tasks/decommission.yml``. The script contract and the per-role ``garbage_collector`` declaration are documented in `garbage_collector.sh.md <../../docs/contributing/artefact/files/role/garbage_collector.sh.md>`__."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role installs a systemd service and a daily timer that run the `garbage_collector.sh` of every application role deployed on the host in `routine` mode. Application roles register their script through `tasks/utils/install.yml`, which writes one entry per application id below `DIR_GARBAGE_COLLECTOR_MANIFESTS`. The [disc space cleaner](../sys-ctl-cln-disc-space/README.md) runs the same dispatcher in `pressure` mode when a disk crosses its threshold. The destructor stage drops the entries of roles no longer active on the host through `tasks/decommission.yml`. The script contract and the per-role `garbage_collector` declaration are documented in [garbage_collector.sh.md](../../docs/contributing/artefact/files/role/garbage_collector.sh.md)."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs a systemd service that sends notifications via both [sys-ctl-alm-telegram](../sys-ctl-alm-telegram/README.md) and [sys-ctl-alm-email](../sys-ctl-alm-email/README.md) when any service fails."
msgstr "Táto rola inštaluje systémovú službu, ktorá posiela oznámenia prostredníctvom oboch [sys-ctl-alm-telegram](../sys-ctl-alm-telegram/README.md) a [sys-ctl-alm-email](../sys-ctl-alm-email/README.md) ak akákoľvek služba zlyhá."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs a systemd service that sends notifications via both `sys-ctl-alm-telegram <../sys-ctl-alm-telegram/README.md>`__ and `sys-ctl-alm-email <../sys-ctl-alm-email/README.md>`__ when any service fails."
msgstr "Táto rola inštaluje systémovú službu, ktorá posiela oznámenia prostredníctvom oboch `sys-ctl-alm-telegram <../sys-ctl-alm-telegram/README.md>`__ a `sys-ctl-alm-email <../sys-ctl-alm-email/README.md>`__ ak akákoľvek služba zlyhá."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs an NFS server in one of two flavors, the distro kernel server or userspace nfs-ganesha, selected per deployment. Both export the swarm state path to the resolved addresses of the ``svc-swarm-node`` group and to an additional CIDR allow-list; ganesha also exports the export base and squashes root there. Export options come from ``vars/main.yml`` for the kernel flavor and from the ganesha configuration template for ganesha. NFS server HA, Kerberos integration, and client-side mounting are out of scope; client mounts are handled by ``svc-storage-nfs-client``."
msgstr "Táto rola nainštaluje NFS server v jednom z dvoch príchutí, distro server jadra alebo užívateľský priestor nfs-ganesha, vybraný pre každé nasadenie. Obaja exportovať roj štátnej cesty na vyriešené adresy ``svc-swarm-node`` skupina a do ďalšieho zoznamu povolení CIDR; ganesha tam tiež vyváža vývoznú základňu a koreň squashov. Vývozné možnosti pochádzajú z ``vars/main.yml`` pre chuť jadra a konfiguračnú šablónu Ganesha pre ganesha. NFS server HA, Kerberos integrácia, a montáž na strane klienta sú mimo rozsah; klientské pripojenia sú riešené ``svc-storage-nfs-client``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs an NFS server in one of two flavors, the distro kernel server or userspace nfs-ganesha, selected per deployment. Both export the swarm state path to the resolved addresses of the `svc-swarm-node` group and to an additional CIDR allow-list; ganesha also exports the export base and squashes root there. Export options come from `vars/main.yml` for the kernel flavor and from the ganesha configuration template for ganesha. NFS server HA, Kerberos integration, and client-side mounting are out of scope; client mounts are handled by `svc-storage-nfs-client`."
msgstr "Táto rola nainštaluje NFS server v jednom z dvoch príchutí, distro server jadra alebo užívateľský priestor nfs-ganesha, vybraný pre každé nasadenie. Obaja exportovať roj štátnej cesty na vyriešené adresy `svc-swarm-node` skupina a do ďalšieho zoznamu povolení CIDR; ganesha tam tiež vyváža vývoznú základňu a koreň squashov. Vývozné možnosti pochádzajú z `vars/main.yml` pre chuť jadra a konfiguračnú šablónu Ganesha pre ganesha. NFS server HA, Kerberos integrácia, a montáž na strane klienta sú mimo rozsah; klientské pripojenia sú riešené `svc-storage-nfs-client`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and applies dotlinker (doli) mappings (generic role)."
msgstr "Táto rola inštaluje a používa dotlinker (doli) mapovanie (Všeobecná úloha)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and configures Git on the target system using the Pacman package manager (via the community.general.pacman module). In addition, it configures Git for the user by installing a custom git configuration using the [git-configurator](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/git-configurator) tool. The role ensures that Git is installed and that the configuration tasks are run only once per host."
msgstr "Táto rola inštaluje a konfiguruje Git o cieľovom systéme pomocou správcu balíkov Pacman (prostredníctvom community.general.pacman modul). Okrem toho konfiguruje Git pre užívateľa inštaláciou vlastného nastavenia git pomocou [git- konfigurátor](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/git-configurator) nástroj. Úloha zabezpečuje, že Git je nainštalovaný a že konfiguračné úlohy sú spustené iba raz na hostiteľa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and configures Git on the target system using the Pacman package manager (via the community.general.pacman module). In addition, it configures Git for the user by installing a custom git configuration using the `git-configurator <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/git-configurator>`__ tool. The role ensures that Git is installed and that the configuration tasks are run only once per host."
msgstr "Táto rola inštaluje a konfiguruje Git o cieľovom systéme pomocou správcu balíkov Pacman (prostredníctvom community.general.pacman modul). Okrem toho konfiguruje Git pre užívateľa inštaláciou vlastného nastavenia git pomocou `git-configurator <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/git-configurator>`__ nástroj. Úloha zabezpečuje, že Git je nainštalovaný a že konfiguračné úlohy sú spustené iba raz na hostiteľa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and configures Nginx HTTP and stream modules with performance-tuned defaults."
msgstr "Táto rola inštaluje a konfiguruje Nginx HTTP a stream moduly s nastaveným výkonom predvolených."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and configures VirtualBox and its kernel modules on Pacman-based systems, including extension packs and user group setup."
msgstr "Táto úloha inštaluje a konfiguruje VirtualBox a jeho moduly jadra na systémoch založených na Pacman, vrátane rozširujúcich balíčkov a nastavenia skupiny užívateľov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and configures the necessary components for sending email notifications via systemd when a service fails. It sets up the ``{{ system_service_id }}`` service and configures email parameters and templates using msmtp."
msgstr "Táto rola nainštaluje a konfiguruje potrebné komponenty pre odosielanie e-mailových oznámení prostredníctvom systémového systému, keď služba zlyhá. Nastavuje ``{{ system_service_id }}`` služby a konfiguruje e-mailové parametre a šablóny pomocou msmtp."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and configures the necessary components for sending email notifications via systemd when a service fails. It sets up the `{{ system_service_id }}` service and configures email parameters and templates using msmtp."
msgstr "Táto rola nainštaluje a konfiguruje potrebné komponenty pre odosielanie e-mailových oznámení prostredníctvom systémového systému, keď služba zlyhá. Nastavuje `{{ system_service_id }}` služby a konfiguruje e-mailové parametre a šablóny pomocou msmtp."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and configures the necessary components for sending notifications via systemd when a service fails. It sets up the ``sys-ctl-alm-telegram`` service and configures parameters and customizable templates for sending messages through `Telegram <https://telegram.org>`__."
msgstr "Táto úloha nainštaluje a nakonfiguruje potrebné komponenty na odosielanie oznámení prostredníctvom systémového systému, keď služba zlyhá. Nastavuje ``sys-ctl-alm-telegram`` služby a konfiguruje parametre a prispôsobiteľné šablóny pre odosielanie správ cez `Telegram <https://telegram.org>`__."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and configures the necessary components for sending notifications via systemd when a service fails. It sets up the `sys-ctl-alm-telegram` service and configures parameters and customizable templates for sending messages through [Telegram](https://telegram.org). <!-- nocheck: url telegram.org answers 404 on the bare root -->"
msgstr "Táto úloha nainštaluje a nakonfiguruje potrebné komponenty na odosielanie oznámení prostredníctvom systémového systému, keď služba zlyhá. Nastavuje `sys-ctl-alm-telegram` služby a konfiguruje parametre a prispôsobiteľné šablóny pre odosielanie správ cez [Telegram](https://telegram.org). <!-- nocheck: url telegram.org odpovede 404 na holom koreni -->"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and maintains the Docker service, including Docker Compose, on Linux systems."
msgstr "Táto úloha nainštaluje a udržiava službu Docker, vrátane Docker Compose, v systémoch Linux."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and maintains the Docker service, including Docker Compose, on Linux systems.   It is part of the [Infinito.Nexus Project](https://s.infinito.nexus/code), maintained and developed by [Kevin Veen-Birkenbach](https://www.veen.world/)."
msgstr "Táto úloha nainštaluje a udržiava službu Docker, vrátane Docker Compose, v systémoch Linux. Je súčasťou [Infinito.Nexus Projekt](https://s.infinito.nexus/code), udržiava a rozvíja [Kevin Veen-Birkenbach](https://www.veen.world/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and runs the **cleanback** tool to automatically detect and remove **failed Docker backups**."
msgstr "Táto úloha inštaluje a spustí **Cleanback** nástroj automaticky detekovať a odstrániť **zlyhali zálohy Docker**."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs caffeine-ng and configures it to autostart for preventing screen sleep on GNOME."
msgstr "Táto rola inštaluje kofeín-ng a konfiguruje ho na automatické spustenie pre zabránenie spánku obrazovky na GNOME."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs distro-specific equivalents of core build tooling so systems are ready for compiling software from source. After deploying this role, all common build dependencies are available on the system."
msgstr "Táto rola inštaluje ditro-špecifické ekvivalenty nástrojov pre stavbu jadra, takže systémy sú pripravené na zostavovanie softvéru zo zdroja. Po nasadení tejto úlohy sú v systéme k dispozícii všetky spoločné stavebné závislosti."

msgid "This role installs one PHP ini (`FILE_PHP_HARDENING_INI`), one interim PHP ini (`FILE_PHP_MEMORY_UNLIMITED_INI`) and one PHP-FPM pool drop-in (`FILE_PHP_FPM_HARDENING_CONF`). A PHP role opts in by declaring a `type: config` entry with that file as `source` and a file inside the scan dir of its image as `target`, e.g. `conf.d/zz-infinito-hardening.ini` or, for the pool, `php-fpm.d/zz-infinito-hardening.conf`. Only roles whose image still ships a PHP release without the CVE-2026-109618 fix also mount `FILE_PHP_MEMORY_UNLIMITED_INI`, as `conf.d/zz-infinito-memory-unlimited.ini`."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role installs one PHP ini (``FILE_PHP_HARDENING_INI``), one interim PHP ini (``FILE_PHP_MEMORY_UNLIMITED_INI``) and one PHP-FPM pool drop-in (``FILE_PHP_FPM_HARDENING_CONF``). A PHP role opts in by declaring a ``type: config`` entry with that file as ``source`` and a file inside the scan dir of its image as ``target``, e.g. ``conf.d/zz-infinito-hardening.ini`` or, for the pool, ``php-fpm.d/zz-infinito-hardening.conf``. Only roles whose image still ships a PHP release without the CVE-2026-109618 fix also mount ``FILE_PHP_MEMORY_UNLIMITED_INI``, as ``conf.d/zz-infinito-memory-unlimited.ini``."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs or upgrades a Python package **system-wide** using the system ``pip`` (``python3 -m pip``). It is intended for CLI tools that should be available globally (e.g., maintenance utilities)."
msgstr "Táto rola inštaluje alebo upgrade Python balíček **systém** používanie systému ``pip`` (``python3 -m pip``). Je určená pre nástroje CLI, ktoré by mali byť dostupné na celom svete (napr. zariadenia na údržbu)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs or upgrades a Python package **system-wide** using the system `pip` (`python3 -m pip`). It is intended for CLI tools that should be available globally (e.g., maintenance utilities)."
msgstr "Táto rola inštaluje alebo upgrade Python balíček **systém** používanie systému `pip` (`python3 -m pip`). Je určená pre nástroje CLI, ktoré by mali byť dostupné na celom svete (napr. zariadenia na údržbu)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the CopyQ clipboard manager on Pacman-based systems (e.g. Arch Linux) and ensures it is started automatically for the current user."
msgstr "Táto úloha inštaluje CopyQ správca schránky na Pacmanových systémoch (napr. Arch Linux) a zaisťuje automatické spustenie pre aktuálneho užívateľa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the CopyQ clipboard manager on Pacman-based systems (e.g. Arch Linux) and ensures it is started automatically for the current user."
msgstr "Táto úloha inštaluje CopyQ správca schránky na Pacmanových systémoch (napr. Arch Linux) a zaisťuje automatické spustenie pre aktuálneho užívateľa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the KeePassXC desktop application on Pacman-based workstations through the system package manager. It is intended for personal-workstation roles in the desktop tier and does not configure databases, browser integrations, or autofill helpers."
msgstr "Táto úloha inštaluje KeePassXC desktopová aplikácia na pracovných staniciach založených na Pacmane prostredníctvom správcu systémových balíkov. Je určený pre role osobnej práce v úrovni plochy a nekonfiguruje databázy, prehliadač integrácie, alebo autofill pomocníkov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the Nix package manager in a **secure, reproducible, and idempotent** way across multiple Linux distributions."
msgstr "Táto úloha nainštaluje Nix správcu balíkov v **bezpečné, reprodukovateľné a nepozorné** cesty cez viaceré Linuxové distribúcie."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the Nix package manager via pacman on Arch x86_64 or via the official installer with SHA256 verification."
msgstr "Táto úloha nainštaluje Nix balíček manažéra prostredníctvom pacman na Arch x86_64 alebo prostredníctvom oficiálneho inštalatéra s SHA256 overenie."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the OBS Studio desktop application on Pacman-based workstations through the system package manager. It targets the desktop tier and does not configure scenes, capture devices, or streaming profiles."
msgstr "Táto úloha inštaluje OBS Studio desktopová aplikácia na pracovných staniciach založených na Pacmane prostredníctvom správcu systémových balíkov. Zameriava sa na úroveň plochy a nenakonfiguruje scény, zachytávacie zariadenia ani streamovacie profily."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the SSH client packages required to enable secure remote access and key-based authentication on Linux systems. It ensures that the appropriate SSH client is installed depending on the target distribution and that the installation is executed only once."
msgstr "Táto rola nainštaluje balíky klientov SSH, ktoré sú potrebné na zabezpečenie vzdialeného prístupu a overenie na základe kľúča v systémoch Linux. Zabezpečuje, aby bol príslušný SSH klient nainštalovaný v závislosti od cieľovej distribúcie a aby bola inštalácia vykonaná len raz."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the [python-pip](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pip_(package_manager)) package on the target system. It ensures that the pip package manager is available for installing Python packages."
msgstr "Táto úloha inštaluje [pytón-pip](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pip_(package_manager)) balík na cieľovom systéme. Zaisťuje, že Pip správca balíkov je k dispozícii pre inštaláciu Python balíčkov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the [sudo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo) package and deploys a default sudoers file to ensure secure and consistent privilege escalation on the target system. It uses a preconfigured sudoers file that follows best practices and includes directives to read drop-in files from `/etc/sudoers.d`."
msgstr "Táto úloha inštaluje [sudo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo) balíček a nasadí predvolený sudoers súbor pre zabezpečenie bezpečné a konzistentné privilégium eskalácie na cieľovom systéme. Používa predkonfigurovaný sudoers súbor, ktorý sa riadi najlepšími postupmi a obsahuje smernice na čítanie súborov z `/etc/sudoers.d`."

msgid "This role installs the ``app-control`` command, writes its configuration, renders the paused page, and, on hosts that also deploy ``web-app-semaphore``, creates the restricted account the Semaphore runner signs in as. The server stage installs all of this once its roles are deployed and before the E2E run; the last step of every deploy applies the persisted pause state of every application on the host. ``sys-svc-compose`` registers each compose instance with it, and the vhost hook in ``sys-front-inj-all`` answers a paused application with HTTP 503 and the paused page."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role installs the ``baudolo`` CLI, lays out the on-host backup tree, deploys the systemd service that drives the periodic run, and wires the cleanup-of-failed-backups dependency so partial snapshots are not retained. Database seeding for individual apps is contributed by the consumer roles via ``tasks/03_seed-database-to-backup.yml``, which they include conditionally once ``svc-bkp-volume-2-local`` is in ``group_names``. The first seed of a play reads ``databases.csv`` once through ``tasks/05_read-seeded-databases.yml``; a consumer whose row already holds its credentials skips ``baudolo-seed``, every other consumer still calls it at its own point in the play. ``baudolo-seed`` gets the password on stdin (``--password-stdin``), so it never shows in the host’s process list."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role installs the `app-control` command, writes its configuration, renders the paused page, and, on hosts that also deploy `web-app-semaphore`, creates the restricted account the Semaphore runner signs in as. The server stage installs all of this once its roles are deployed and before the E2E run; the last step of every deploy applies the persisted pause state of every application on the host. `sys-svc-compose` registers each compose instance with it, and the vhost hook in `sys-front-inj-all` answers a paused application with HTTP 503 and the paused page."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role installs the `baudolo` CLI, lays out the on-host backup tree, deploys the systemd service that drives the periodic run, and wires the cleanup-of-failed-backups dependency so partial snapshots are not retained. Database seeding for individual apps is contributed by the consumer roles via `tasks/03_seed-database-to-backup.yml`, which they include conditionally once `svc-bkp-volume-2-local` is in `group_names`. The first seed of a play reads `databases.csv` once through `tasks/05_read-seeded-databases.yml`; a consumer whose row already holds its credentials skips `baudolo-seed`, every other consumer still calls it at its own point in the play. `baudolo-seed` gets the password on stdin (`--password-stdin`), so it never shows in the host's process list."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the `python-pip <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pip_(package_manager)>`__ package on the target system. It ensures that the pip package manager is available for installing Python packages."
msgstr "Táto úloha inštaluje `python-pip <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pip_(package_manager)>`__ balík na cieľovom systéme. Zaisťuje, že Pip správca balíkov je k dispozícii pre inštaláciu Python balíčkov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the `sudo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo>`__ package and deploys a default sudoers file to ensure secure and consistent privilege escalation on the target system. It uses a preconfigured sudoers file that follows best practices and includes directives to read drop-in files from ``/etc/sudoers.d``."
msgstr "Táto úloha inštaluje `sudo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo>`__ balíček a nasadí predvolený sudoers súbor pre zabezpečenie bezpečné a konzistentné privilégium eskalácie na cieľovom systéme. Používa predkonfigurovaný sudoers súbor, ktorý sa riadi najlepšími postupmi a obsahuje smernice na čítanie súborov z ``/etc/sudoers.d``."

msgid "This role installs the backup script and the systemd service that drives it on the configured schedule (`SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_NFS_TO_LOCAL`), and first waits for the rest of the manipulation group via [sys-lock](../sys-lock/), up to `SYS_TIMEOUT_BACKUP_SERVICES`. The source path is the NFS export base resolved from the [svc-storage-nfs-server](../svc-storage-nfs-server/) services SPOT; deploy the role on the host that serves the export. Deploy [sys-ctl-cln-bkps](../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/) to keep the snapshot tree bounded and [user-backup](../user-backup/) so downstream hosts can pull the tree."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role installs the backup script and the systemd service that drives it on the configured schedule (``SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_NFS_TO_LOCAL``), and first waits for the rest of the manipulation group via `sys-lock <../sys-lock/>`__, up to ``SYS_TIMEOUT_BACKUP_SERVICES``. The source path is the NFS export base resolved from the `svc-storage-nfs-server <../svc-storage-nfs-server/>`__ services SPOT; deploy the role on the host that serves the export. Deploy `sys-ctl-cln-bkps <../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/>`__ to keep the snapshot tree bounded and `user-backup <../user-backup/>`__ so downstream hosts can pull the tree."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the distro-appropriate NFS client packages on every host in the Ansible group ``svc-swarm-node`` and probe-mounts the configured ``storage.nfs.server`` and the export base from the svc-storage-nfs-server services.yml SPOT to confirm reachability and writability at deploy time. The actual docker volume mounts happen later, driven by the Docker engine at container start."
msgstr "Táto úloha nainštaluje distro-vhodné balíky NFS klientov na každom hostiteľa v Ansible skupine ``svc-swarm-node`` a sonda spojí nakonfigurované ``storage.nfs.server`` a exportný základ z svc-storage-nfs-server services.yml SPOT potvrdí dosiahnuteľnosť a vierohodnosť v čase nasadenia. Skutočný dockerový objem sa namontuje neskôr, poháňaný dockerovým motorom pri štarte nádrže."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the distro-appropriate NFS client packages on every host in the Ansible group `svc-swarm-node` and probe-mounts the configured `storage.nfs.server` and the export base from the svc-storage-nfs-server services.yml SPOT to confirm reachability and writability at deploy time. The actual docker volume mounts happen later, driven by the Docker engine at container start."
