msgid "[`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` in every matrix variant, because the shared persona helper cannot drive this role's sign-in in any of them. Three independent reasons, each sufficient on its own:"
msgstr "[`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) vykresľovanie `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` a `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` v každom variante matice, pretože zdieľaná osoba pomocník nemôže riadiť túto rolu prihlásenie v žiadnom z nich. Tri nezávislé dôvody, z ktorých každý sám osebe stačí:"

