msgid "`INFINITO_GHCR_MIRROR` decides whether a run uses the mirror. The generated `.env` sets it to `true` on a real GitHub runner and to `false` everywhere else, act included. A non-empty exported value overrides that for one run. [call-test-workspace.yml](../../../../.github/workflows/call-test-workspace.yml) exports `true`, so the workspace suite runs like a local setup and still pulls from GHCR, in its compose drills and, through `make swarm-zombie`, in its swarm drills."
