msgid "`MM_EMAILSETTINGS_ENABLESIGNUPWITHEMAIL` and `MM_TEAMSETTINGS_ENABLEOPENSERVER`; Keycloak accounts are still created at their first sign-in"
msgstr ""

msgid "`MM_EXPERIMENTALSETTINGS_DISABLELANDINGPAGE` in `templates/env.j2` does not switch the landing page off: the deployed 11.11.1 still hands `EnableDesktopLandingPage: \"true\"` to its client (measured through `/api/v4/config/client` on the compose stack), so a first visit lands on `/landing` and the specs seed `localStorage.__landingPageSeen__`. Options: set `MM_SERVICESETTINGS_ENABLEDESKTOPLANDINGPAGE=false`; or keep the page and drop the dead variable."
msgstr ""

msgid "`MM_GITLABSETTINGS_*` (the Keycloak entry in the GitLab slot), the Keycloak mappers of `tasks/02_keycloak.yml` and the conversion of the administrator to GitLab auth in `tasks/03_oidc_admin.yml`"
