msgid "`MM_SERVICESETTINGS_ENABLEMULTIFACTORAUTHENTICATION`, offered to email accounts. `login.method.2fa.enforced` only offers it here: `ServiceSettings.EnforceMultifactorAuthentication` is reported without effect on the Team Edition this role installs, so the role does not render it"
msgstr ""

msgid "`MOODLE_PROXY_EXCLUDED_HOSTS` feeds `no_proxy` and carries `lookup('proxy_excluded_hosts')` (loopback and the object store), `MOODLE_MCP_SERVICE_KEY` and, when the `litellm` service is on, the gateway host. The MCP entry is the `nginx` sidecar that `tasks/utils/mcp/verify.yml` probes with the `curl` binary from inside the container: `plugins/filter/curl.py` emits no `--noproxy`, `container exec` inherits the container environment, and Tor cannot resolve a Docker service name, so without the exemption that probe exhausts its retries and fails the deploy. Clearnet hosts such as the update checker's are deliberately left out, so they travel through Tor like the rest of the node's egress."
msgstr ""

msgid "`Mailu-OIDC 2024.06.18 (floating: ``2024.06``) <https://github.com/heviat/Mailu-OIDC/blob/2024.06.18/core/admin/mailu/oidc.py#L236-L261>`__ (closest tag to the floating ``2024.06`` image), `route <https://github.com/heviat/Mailu-OIDC/blob/2024.06.18/core/admin/mailu/sso/views/base.py#L161-L168>`__, `Roundcube session <https://github.com/heviat/Mailu-OIDC/blob/2024.06.18/webmails/roundcube/config/config.inc.php#L17>`__"
msgstr ""

