msgstr ""

msgid "`files/playwright/test-seaweedfs.js` fails on a stack with `seaweedfs` on and `sso` off (measured: `input[type=\"file\"]` never attaches on `/preferences/profile`, 3 of 3 attempts): the action only signs in through Keycloak, so without SSO it stays anonymous and lands on `/login`. Options: sign in through BookWyrm's own `/login` form with the provisioned administrator when `sso` is off, or skip unless `sso` is enabled."
